hadiths[648]{hadithnumber,text}:
"7163","[AI-translation] Main tek laga kar nahi khata."
"7164","[AI-translation] Us shakhs ke liye koi ajr nahi jis ke paas ihtisab (sawab ki niyat) na ho."
"7165","[AI-translation] Allah se zyada ghairatmand koi nahi, isi liye us ne behayaai ko haraam kiya, us ka zahir aur baatin; aur Allah se zyada tareef pasand koi nahi, isi liye us ne apni tareef ki; aur Allah se zyada uzr pasand koi nahi, isi liye us ne kitab nazil ki aur Rasool bheje."
"7166","[AI-translation] Islam mein khusi karna nahi hai."
"7167","[AI-translation] Main arghawan nahi pehnta, na ma'asfar pehnta hoon, na aisi qamees pehnta hoon jis ke kinare resham se bandhe hon. Sun lo! Mardon ki khushbu mein bas khushbu hoti hai rang nahi, aur aurton ki khushbu mein rang hota hai khushbu nahi."
"7168","[AI-translation] Islam mein matam mein madad karna nahi, na qabr par janwar zibah karna, na shighar, na jalb, na janab; aur jis ne loot machai wo hum mein se nahi."
"7169","[AI-translation] Na chori chhupe karna hai na ghanimat mein khayanat."
"7170","[AI-translation] Main use jhoota nahi samajhta: wo aadmi jo logon ke darmiyan sulah karata hai aur aisi baat kehta hai jis se sirf sulah ka iraada hota hai; aur wo aadmi jo jung mein baat kehta hai; aur wo aadmi jo apni biwi se baat karta hai; aur wo aurat jo apne shohar se baat karti hai."
"7171","[AI-translation] Khabardar! Tum mein se koi na mare jab main tumhare darmiyan hoon magar tum mujhe ittila do; beshak meri us par namaz us ke liye rehmat hai."
"7172","[AI-translation] Main tum mein se kisi ko aise na paun jo apne takht par tek laga kar baithe aur us ke paas mere amr mein se koi hukm aaye jo main ne diya ya jis se main ne mana kiya ho, to wo kahe: Mujhe maloom nahi, hum ne Allah ki kitab mein jo paya usi ki pairwi ki."
"7173","[AI-translation] Main tum mein se kisi ko qayamat ke din apni gardan par apna oont laaye hue na paun jo garaj raha ho aur kahe: Ae Allah ke Rasool, meri madad karo! To main kahunga: Main tumhare liye kuch nahi kar sakta, main ne tumhe pahuncha diya tha. Main tum mein se kisi ko qayamat ke din apni gardan par apna ghora laaye hue na paun jo hinhina raha ho aur kahe: Ae Allah ke Rasool, meri madad karo! To main kahunga: Main tumhare liye kuch nahi kar sakta, main ne tumhe pahuncha diya tha. Main tum mein se kisi ko qayamat ke din apni gardan par apni bakri laaye hue na paun jo mema rahi ho aur kahe: Ae Allah ke Rasool, meri madad karo! To main kahunga: Main tumhare liye kuch nahi kar sakta, main ne tumhe pahuncha diya tha. Main tum mein se kisi ko qayamat ke din apni gardan par aisi jaan laaye hue na paun jo cheekh rahi ho aur kahe: Ae Allah ke Rasool, meri madad karo! To main kahunga: Main tumhare liye kuch nahi kar sakta, main ne tumhe pahuncha diya tha. Main tum mein se kisi ko qayamat ke din apni gardan par kaghaz ke tukde laaye hue na paun jo hawa mein phadphadate hon aur kahe: Ae Allah ke Rasool, meri madad karo! To main kahunga: Main tumhare liye kuch nahi kar sakta, main ne tumhe pahuncha diya tha. Main tum mein se kisi ko qayamat ke din apni gardan par khamosh maal laaye hue na paun aur kahe: Ae Allah ke Rasool, meri madad karo! To main kahunga: Main tumhare liye kuch nahi kar sakta, main ne tumhe pahuncha diya tha."
"7174","[AI-translation] Main tum mein se kisi ko aise na paun jo qayamat ke din Tihama ke pahadon jaisi safed nekiyan laaye aur Allah unhe bikhri hui dhool bana de. Sun lo! Wo tumhare bhai hain aur tumhari hi jins se hain, aur raat ka hissa bhi tumhari tarah lete hain, lekin wo aise log hain ke jab Allah ki haraam cheezon mein akela hote hain to unhe pamaal kar dete hain."
"7175","[AI-translation] La ilaha illallah! Beshak maut ke sakarat hain."
"7176","[AI-translation] La ilaha illallah! Wail hai Arab ke liye us shar se jo qareeb aa gaya. Aaj Ya'juj ke bandh se itna hissa khul gaya hai - aur apni do ungliyon, angootha aur us ke saath wali, se ishara kiya - kaha gaya: Kya hum halak honge jab ke hum mein neik log maujood hain? Farmaya: Haan, jab burai zyada ho jaye."
"7177","[AI-translation] Main aurton ke haath nahi chhuta."
"7178","[AI-translation] Allah ki qasam! Aisi sawari hamare saath nahi rahegi jis par laanat ho."
"7179","[AI-translation] Us ka iman nahi jis mein amanat nahi, aur us ka deen nahi jis mein ahad nahi."
"7180","[AI-translation] Kahinon ke paas na jao."
"7181","[AI-translation] Koi haraj nahi ke janwar ek ke badle do ho, haath ba haath."
"7182","[AI-translation] Ghina us ke liye haraj nahi jo parhezgar ho; aur sehat us ke liye jo parhezgar ho ghina se behtar hai; aur khush-tabai neamat hai."
"7183","[AI-translation] Gandum ko jau ke badle do ke ek haath ba haath bechna koi haraj nahi."
"7184","[AI-translation] Koi haraj nahi; aur aadmi ko apne bhai ki madad karni chahiye chahe wo zalim ho ya mazloom. Agar wo zalim ho to use rok de, yehi us ki madad hai; aur agar mazloom ho to us ki madad kare."
"7185","[AI-translation] Aref ka hona zaroori hai, lekin aref aag mein hoga."
"7186","[AI-translation] Safar mein roza rakhne mein koi neki nahi."
"7187","[AI-translation] Sau saal aise nahi guzrenge ke zameen par aaj ki koi jaan zinda rahe."
"7188","[AI-translation] Koi aurat apne shohar ke ghar mein us ki ijazat ke baghair kisi ko aane ki ijazat na de.. ..."
"7189","[AI-translation] Azan na do yahan tak ke fajr tumhare liye is tarah wazeh ho jaye."
"7190","[AI-translation] Use mat aane do jo pehle salam na kare."
"7191","[AI-translation] Tum kisi musalman ko kafir ki gaali de kar aazari na do."
"7192","[AI-translation] Koi aurat duniya mein apne shohar ko aazari na deti magar hoor-e-een mein se us ki biwi kahti hai: Use aazari na de, Allah tujhe halak kare! Wo to tere paas sirf ek mehman hai, bahut jald tujh se juda ho kar hamare paas aa jayega."
"7193","[AI-translation] Piyaz na khao.. ..."
"7194","[AI-translation] Baayein haath se na khao, kyunke shaitan baayein haath se khata hai."
"7195","[AI-translation] Imam se pishqadmi na karo; jab wo takbeer kahe to tum bhi takbeer kaho; aur jab wo walad-dalleen kahe to tum Ameen kaho; aur jab wo ruku kare to tum ruku karo; aur jab wo kahe sami Allahu liman hamidah to tum kaho Allahumma Rabbana wa lakal hamd; aur us se pehle apna sar na uthao."
"7196","[AI-translation] Mujh se ruku aur sajde mein pishqadmi na karo, kyunke jab main ruku mein tum se pehle jaata hoon to jab main uthta hoon tum mujhe pa lete ho; aur jab main sajde mein tum se pehle jaata hoon to jab main uthta hoon tum mujhe pa lete ho. Main bojhal ho gaya hoon."
"7197","[AI-translation] Koi aurat doosri aurat se us ke jism ki tafseel bayan na kare ke use apne shohar ke saamne aise bayan kare jaise wo use dekh raha ho."
"7198","[AI-translation] Khane ka dher khane ke dher ke badle nahi becha jayega, aur na khane ka dher naap kar diye gaye khane ke badle."
"7199","[AI-translation] Aapas mein bughz na rakho, ek doosre se qata-talliq na karo, ek doosre se raqibat na karo, aur Allah ke bande bhai bhai ban jao."
"7200","[AI-translation] Aapas mein bughz na rakho, qata-talliq na karo, pith peeche burai na karo, hasad na karo, aur Allah ke bande bhai bhai ban jao jaise Allah ne tumhe hukm diya; aur kisi musalman ke liye jaiz nahi ke apne bhai se teen din se zyada qata-talliq rakhe."
"7201","[AI-translation] Khajoor ko na kharido jab tak us ki salahiyat zahir na ho jaye, aur khajoor ko khajoor ke badle na kharido."
"7202","[AI-translation] Phal ko na kharido jab tak us ki salahiyat zahir na ho jaye aur us se aafat door na ho jaye."
"7203","[AI-translation] Sone ko sone ke badle na becho magar barabar barabar, na un mein zyada ho, na udhar."
"7204","[AI-translation] Yahud aur nasrani ko pehle salam na karo; aur jab tum un mein se kisi ko raaste mein mile to use tang raaste ki taraf dhakel do."
"7205","[AI-translation] Khana na becho jab tak use kharid kar poora qabza na kar lo."
"7206","[AI-translation] Jo cheez tumhare paas nahi wo na becho."
"7207","[AI-translation] Kisi oont ki gardan mein tar ki mala na chhodo magar use kaat do."
"7208","[AI-translation] Us par mat roya karo; farishte use apne paron se gherte rahe hain yahan tak ke tum ne use utha diya."
"7209","[AI-translation] Dinar ko do dinaron ke badle na becho aur dirham ko do dirham ke badle na becho."
"7210","[AI-translation] Sone ko sone ke badle na becho magar barabar barabar, aur chandi ko chandi ke badle magar barabar barabar; aur sone ko chandi ke badle aur chandi ko sone ke badle jis tarah chaho becho."
"7211","[AI-translation] Sone ko sone ke badle na becho magar misl ba misl barabar, na us ke kisi hisse mein kami karo; aur chandi ko chandi ke badle na becho magar misl ba misl barabar, na us ke kisi hisse mein kami karo; aur un mein se kisi ko udhar ke badle naqad na becho."
"7212","[AI-translation] Sone ko sone ke badle na becho magar wazan ba wazan."
"7213","[AI-translation] Sone ko sone ke badle aur chandi ko chandi ke badle na becho magar wazan ba wazan, misl ba misl, barabar barabar."
"7214","[AI-translation] Zameen ki jageer na banao warna duniya mein raghbat karne lago."
"7215","[AI-translation] Masjidon ko raasta na banao magar zikr ya namaz ke liye."
"7216","[AI-translation] Apne gharon ko qabristan na banao."
"7217","[AI-translation] Apne gharon ko qabristan na banao; un mein namaz padho."
"7218","[AI-translation] Kisi jaan wali cheez ko nishana na banao."
"7219","[AI-translation] Ye ummat pichli ummaton ki sunnat mein se koi cheez chhodegi nahi balke use bhi apna legi."
"7220","[AI-translation] Sote waqt apne gharon mein aag na chhodo."
"7221","[AI-translation] Maut ki tamanna na karo."
"7222","[AI-translation] Dushman se milne ki tamanna na karo; aur jab un se muloqat ho to sabr karo."
"7223","[AI-translation] Quran mein jhagda na karo, kyunke is mein jhagda kufr hai."
"7224","[AI-translation] Aadmi ki namaz tab tak poori nahi hoti jab tak wo ruku aur sajde mein apni peeth seedhi na kare."
"7225","[AI-translation] Aisi namaz poori nahi hoti jis mein aadmi ruku aur sajde mein apni reedh seedhi na kare."
"7226","[AI-translation] Apne gharon ko qabristan na banao aur meri qabr ko Eid ka maidan na banao; mujh par durud bhejo, kyunke tumhara durud jahan bhi ho mujhe pahunchta hai."
"7227","[AI-translation] Apne gharon ko qabristan na banao; beshak shaitan us ghar se bhagta hai jis mein Surah Baqarah padhi jati hai."
"7228","[AI-translation] Do aadmiyon ke darmiyan un ki ijazat ke baghair na baitho."
"7229","[AI-translation] Qabron par na baitho aur un ki taraf namaz na padho."
"7230","[AI-translation] Jhoot aur bhookh ko jama na karo."
"7231","[AI-translation] Mere naam aur meri kunyat ko ek saath na rakho."
"7232","[AI-translation] Taza khajoor aur kachchi khajoor ko mila kar, aur kishmish aur khajoor ko mila kar nabeedh na banao."
"7233","[AI-translation] Koi maa apne bachche ke jurm mein pakri nahi jayegi."
"7234","[AI-translation] Koi jaan doosri jaan ke jurm ki pakri nahi jayegi."
"7235","[AI-translation] Dehati ki gawahi shahar wale ke khilaf jaiz nahi."
"7236","[AI-translation] Kisi khain ki gawahi jaiz nahi, na khaina ki, na zani ki, na zaniya ki, na us shakhs ki jo Islam mein apne bhai ke saath keena rakhta ho."
"7237","[AI-translation] Badguman aur keena rakhne wale ki gawahi jaiz nahi."
"7238","[AI-translation] Kisi aurat ke liye jaiz nahi ke apne maal mein kuch hadiya de magar apne shohar ki ijazat se, jab us ka shohar us ki asmat ka malik ho."
"7239","[AI-translation] Kodhi walon ko dekhte mat raho."
"7240","[AI-translation] Ek luqma ya do luqme doodh pila kar hurmat sabit nahi hoti."
"7241","[AI-translation] Ek choos ya do choos doodh se hurmat sabit nahi hoti."
"7242","[AI-translation] Hasad na karo, najash na karo, bughz na rakho, pith peeche burai na karo, aur ek doosre ki bechai par bechai na karo; Allah ke bande bhai bhai ban jao. Musalman musalman ka bhai hai, na use zaleel karta hai, na use chor deta hai, na use haqeer samajhta hai. Taqwa yahan hai - apne seene ki taraf ishara kiya -. Aadmi ke liye burai mein yehi kaafi hai ke wo apne musalman bhai ko haqeer samjhe. Har musalman ka musalman par khoon, maal aur izzat haraam hai."
"7243","[AI-translation] Apni namaz ko sooraj nikalne ya doobne ke waqt na rakho, kyunke wo shaitan ke do singon ke darmiyan nikalta hai."
"7244","[AI-translation] Ye na samjho ke hum ne bakri sirf tumhare liye zibah ki hai; hamare paas sau bakriyan hain, hum un se barhna nahi chahte; pas jab charwaha bachcha paida karta hai to hum us ki jagah ek bakri zibah kar dete hain."
"7245","[AI-translation] Neki ko haqeer na samjho, agarche ye ho ke apne bhai se khush-chehre ho kar milo."
"7246","[AI-translation] Apne baap-dadon ki qasam na khao."
"7247","[AI-translation] Apne baap-dadon ki qasam na khao; jis ne Allah ki qasam khai wo sach bole, aur jis se Allah ki qasam li jaye wo raazi ho; aur jo Allah se raazi na ho wo Allah se nahi."
"7248","[AI-translation] Apne baap-dadon aur buton ki qasam na khao."
"7249","[AI-translation] Apne baap-dadon, apni maon aur buton ki qasam na khao; Allah ke siwa kisi ki qasam na khao, aur qasam na khao magar sach bolte hue."
"7250","[AI-translation] Sadqa ghani ke liye jaiz nahi magar paanch ke liye: Allah ki raah mein jihad karne wale, ya us par aamil, ya qarzdar, ya wo aadmi jis ne use apne maal se kharida, ya wo aadmi jis ka padosi miskeen ho, us ne miskeen par sadqa kiya aur miskeen ne wo ghani ko hadiya kar diya."
"7251","[AI-translation] Sadqa ghani ke liye jaiz nahi aur na us ke liye jo tan-durust aur mehnat karne ke qabil ho."
"7252","[AI-translation] Loot ka maal halal nahi, na har daant wala darinda halal hai, na bandhi hui jaan halal hai."
"7253","[AI-translation] Koi aurat pehle shohar ke liye halal nahi hoti jab tak doosra shohar us se jima na kare."
"7254","[AI-translation] Raaton mein se khaas Jumma ki raat ko qiyam ke liye mat chuno, aur dinon mein se khaas Jumma ke din roza mat chuno, magar ye ke wo tum mein se kisi ke rozon mein se ho."
"7255","[AI-translation] Ikhtilaf na karo, kyunke tum se pehle log ikhtilaf karte rahe aur halak ho gaye."
"7256","[AI-translation] Ikhtilaf na karo warna tumhare dil mukhtalif ho jayenge."
"7257","[AI-translation] Nabiyon ke darmiyan mujhe tarjeeh na do, kyunke qayamat ke din log be-hosh honge; main zameen se sab se pehle uthaya jaunga, to Musa Arsh ke ek sutoon ko pakre hue honge; mujhe maloom nahi ke wo un mein honge jo be-hosh hue ya unhe us ki pehli be-hoshi ka hisab diya gaya."
"7258","[AI-translation] Mujhe Musa par fazeelat na do; qayamat ke din log be-hosh honge, main bhi un ke saath be-hosh hounga, phir main sab se pehle hosh mein aaunga to Musa Arsh ke ek kinare ko pakre hue honge. Mujhe maloom nahi ke wo un mein honge jo be-hosh hue aur mujh se pehle hosh mein aaye, ya wo un mein honge jinhe Allah ne mustasna kiya."
"7259","[AI-translation] Apne aap ko qarz se na darao."
"7260","[AI-translation] Farishte us ghar mein dakhil nahi hote jis mein buthein ya tasveerein hon."
"7261","[AI-translation] Farishte us ghar mein dakhil nahi hote jis mein tasveer ho, magar kapde par bana hua naqsh ho."
"7262","[AI-translation] Farishte us ghar mein dakhil nahi hote jis mein kutta ya tasveer ho."
"7263","[AI-translation] In azaab diye gaye logon ke paas na jao magar rote hue; pas agar tum ro nahi sakte to un ke paas na jao, kahin tumhe wohi musibat na pahunche jo unhe pahunchi."
"7264","[AI-translation] Koi buth na chhodo magar use mita do, aur koi oonchi qabr na chhodo magar use baraabar kar do."
"7265","[AI-translation] Maut ki dua na maango aur us ki tamanna na karo; pas jo dua karne wala ho aur zaroorat ho to kahe: Allahumma ahyini ma kanat-il-hayatu khairan li wa tawaffani iza kanat-il-wafatu khairan li."
"7266","[AI-translation] Apne nafs ke liye bura nahi maango magar bhalai; kyunke farishte tumhari baat par Ameen kahte hain."
"7267","[AI-translation] Apne nafs ke khilaf dua na karo, na apni aulad ke khilaf, na apne khidmatgaron ke khilaf, na apne maalon ke khilaf; aisa na ho ke tum Allah se aisi sa'at mein maango jis mein wo ata karta hai aur tumhari dua qubool ho jaye."
"7268","[AI-translation] Apne murdon ko raat mein dafan na karo magar majboori ho."
"7269","[AI-translation] Kodhi walon ko lagatar dekhte na raho."
"7270","[AI-translation] Doodh dene wali janwar ko zibah na karo."
"7271","[AI-translation] Apne murdon ka zikr sirf bhalai ke saath karo."
"7272","[AI-translation] Duniya khatam nahi hogi yahan tak ke wo Laka' bin Laka' ke qabze mein aa jaye."
"7273","[AI-translation] Din raat khatam nahi honge yahan tak ke meri ummat ka ek giroh sharaab piyega aur use doosra naam dega."
"7274","[AI-translation] Din raat khatam nahi honge yahan tak ke ek aadmi badshah banega jise Jahjah kaha jayega."
"7275","[AI-translation] Duniya khatam nahi hogi aur qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke mere ahl-e-bait mein se ek aadmi badshah banega jis ka naam mere naam se milta hoga."
"7276","[AI-translation] Mere baad kafir na ban jao ke tum mein se kuch log doosron ki gardanein kaatne lagein."
"7277","[AI-translation] Mere baad kafir na ban jao ke tum mein se kuch log doosron ki gardanein kaatne lagein; aur na kisi aadmi ko us ke baap ke jurm par pakra jayega aur na us ke bhai ke jurm par."
"7278","[AI-translation] Sooraj doobne ke baad apne chaupaye aur bachche mat chhodo yahan tak ke isha ki andheri ho jaye; kyunke shaitan sooraj doobne ke waqt bheje jate hain yahan tak ke isha ki andheri ho jaye."
"7279","[AI-translation] Apne baap-dadon se raghbat na phero; pas jis ne apne baap se raghbat pher li to wo kufr hai."
"7280","[AI-translation] Namaz mein apni nigahein aasman ki taraf na uthao kahin tumhari aankhein uchak li na jayein."
"7281","[AI-translation] Apne maalon mein ruqba na karo; pas jis ne kisi cheez ka ruqba kiya to wo usi ka hai jis ke liye ruqba kiya."
"7282","[AI-translation] Na ruqba karo na umra; pas jis ne kisi cheez ka umra ya ruqba kiya to wo marne ke baad waris ka hai."
"7283","[AI-translation] Resham mila kar bane kapde aur chiton ki khaal par sawari na karo."
"7284","[AI-translation] Meri ummat us waqt tak bhalai par rahegi jab tak iftar jaldi kare.. ..."
"7285","[AI-translation] Meri ummat fitrat par rahegi jab tak maghrib ko sitare dikhne tak der na kare."
"7286","[AI-translation] Jahannam mein log daale jate rahenge aur wo kahegi: Kya kuch zyada hai? Yahan tak ke Rabb-ul-Izzat apna qadam us mein rakhega to us ke hisse ek doosre se simat jayenge aur wo kahegi: Bas bas! Teri izzat aur karam ki qasam! Aur jannat mein jagah baqi rahegi yahan tak ke Allah us ke liye nayi makhlooq paida karega aur unhe jannat ki fazil jagah mein basayega."
"7287","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ka ek giroh haq par zahir rahega yahan tak ke qayamat qaim ho jaye."
"7288","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ka ek giroh zahir rahega yahan tak ke un ke paas Allah ka hukm aa jaye aur wo zahir honge."
"7289","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ka ek giroh haq par zahir rahega; unhe chhod dene wale un ka kuch nahi bigaad sakenge yahan tak ke Allah ka hukm aa jaye aur wo isi haal mein honge."
"7290","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ka ek giroh Allah ke hukm par qaim rahega; unhe chhod dene wala aur un ki mukhalifat karne wala un ka kuch nahi bigaad sakega yahan tak ke Allah ka hukm aa jaye aur wo logon par zahir honge."
"7291","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ka ek giroh Allah ke amr par qaim rahega; jis ne un ki mukhalifat ki wo un ka kuch nahi bigaad sakega."
"7292","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ka ek giroh mansoor rahega; unhe chhod dene wale ki khiyanat un ka kuch nahi bigaad sakegi yahan tak ke qayamat qaim ho jaye."
"7293","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ka ek giroh haq par larte hue zahir rahega qayamat ke din tak. Pas Isa bin Maryam nazil honge to un ka amir kahega: Aao hamari namaz padhao. Wo kahenge: Nahi, tum mein se kuch doosron ke amir hain, Allah ki taraf se is ummat ke liye ikram hai."
"7294","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ka ek giroh haq par larte hue un par zahir rahega jo un se dushmani karein yahan tak ke un ka aakhri shakhs Masih Dajjal se larega."
"7295","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ka ek giroh haq par larta rahega; un ki mukhalifat karne wala un ka kuch nahi bigaad sakega yahan tak ke un ke paas qayamat aa jaye aur wo isi haal mein hon."
"7296","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ka ek giroh Allah ke amr par larte hue apne dushman par ghalib rahega; un ki mukhalifat karne wala un ka kuch nahi bigaad sakega yahan tak ke un ke paas qayamat aa jaye aur wo isi haal mein hon."
"7297","[AI-translation] Apne aap ko paak na kaho; Allah behtar janta hai tum mein neik kaun hai. Us ka naam Zainab rakho."
"7298","[AI-translation] Aurat aurat ki nikah na kare aur na aurat apna nikah khud kare.. ..."
"7299","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din Ibn Adam ke qadam apne Rab ke paas se hatenge nahi yahan tak ke us se paanch cheezon ke baare mein pucha jayega: us ki umar ke baare mein ke use kis mein khatam kiya? Us ki jawani ke baare mein ke use kis mein thaka? Us ke maal ke baare mein ke kahan se kamaya aur kis mein kharch kiya? Aur us ne jo ilm paya us par kya amal kiya?"
"7300","[AI-translation] Kisi bande ke qadam hatenge nahi yahan tak ke us se chaar cheezon ke baare mein pucha jayega: us ki umar ke baare mein ke use kis mein khatam kiya, us ke ilm ke baare mein ke us par kya amal kiya, us ke maal ke baare mein ke kahan se kamaya aur kis mein kharch kiya, aur us ke jism ke baare mein ke use kis mein ghisaya."
"7301","[AI-translation] Aurat safar na kare magar mahram ke saath, aur us ke paas koi mard dakhil na ho magar us ke saath mahram ho."
"7302","[AI-translation] Aurat ek barid ka safar na kare magar mahram ke saath jo us par haraam ho."
"7303","[AI-translation] Aurat teen din ka safar na kare magar mahram ke saath."
"7304","[AI-translation] Aurat do din ki musafat na kare magar us ke shohar ya us ka mahram saath ho; aur do dinon mein roza nahi: Eid-ul-Fitr aur Eid-ul-Adha."
"7305","[AI-translation] Quran le kar safar na karo, kyunke mujhe dar hai ke dushman us par qabza na kar le."
"7306","[AI-translation] Koi aurat apni behan ke talaq ki darkhwast na kare taake us ka bartan khaali kare aur khud nikah kar le; us ke liye wohi hoga jo us ke liye muqarrar hua."
"7307","[AI-translation] Logon se kuch na maango, agarche tumhara koda tum se gir jaye yahan tak ke tum khud utar kar use utha lo."
"7308","[AI-translation] Tum qayamat ke din tak mujh se koi cheez nahi puchoge magar main tumhe us ke baare mein bataunga."
"7309","[AI-translation] Kisi ko gaali na do, aur neki ko haqeer na samjho, agarche ye ho ke apne bhai se khush-chehre ho kar baat karo; ye bhi neki hai. Aur apna tehband aadhi pindli tak rakho; agar na chaho to takhno tak; aur tehband latka kar na pehno, kyunke ye takabbur hai, aur Allah takabbur pasand nahi karta. Aur agar koi tumhe gaali de aur tum mein jo aib wo janta ho us se aib-joi kare to us ke aib ka zikr na karo jo tum jante ho; kyunke us ka wabaal usi par hoga."
"7310","[AI-translation] Mere sahaba ko gaali na do; qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, agar tum mein se koi Uhud ke barabar sona kharch kare to un ke ek mud ya nisf mud ke barabar nahi pahunch sakta."
"7311","[AI-translation] Murdon ko gaali na do, kyunke wo apne kiye hue amal ki taraf pahunch chuke hain."
"7312","[AI-translation] Murdon ko gaali na do ke zindon ko aazari pahunchao."
"7313","[AI-translation] Zamane ko gaali na do, kyunke Allah hi zamana hai."
"7314","[AI-translation] Murgha ko gaali na do, kyunke wo namaz ke liye jagata hai."
"7315","[AI-translation] Hawa ko gaali na do; pas jab tum wo cheez dekho jo na pasand karo to kaho: Allahumma inni as'aluka min khairi hazihir-reeh wa khairi ma feeha wa khairi ma umirat bihi, wa a'uzu bika min sharri hazihir-reeh wa sharri ma feeha wa sharri ma umirat bihi."
"7316","[AI-translation] Hawa ko gaali na do, kyunke wo Allah ki rehmat se hai; wo rehmat aur azab le kar aati hai; lekin Allah se us ki bhalai maango aur us ke shar se Allah ki panah maango."
"7317","[AI-translation] Hawa ko gaali na do, kyunke wo Allah ki taraf se hai; Allah se us ki bhalai, us mein jo hai us ki bhalai aur jis ke saath bheji gayi us ki bhalai maango; aur Allah ki panah maango us ke shar, us mein jo hai us ke shar aur jis ke saath bheji gayi us ke shar se."
"7318","[AI-translation] Shaitan ko gaali na do aur us ke shar se Allah ki panah maango."
"7319","[AI-translation] Tubba' ko gaali na do, kyunke wo musalman ho gaya tha."
"7320","[AI-translation] Warqa bin Naufal ko gaali na do, kyunke main ne un ke liye jannat ya do jannatein dekhi hain."
"7321","[AI-translation] Bukhar ko gaali na do, kyunke wo Ibn Adam ke gunahon ko aise door karta hai jaise bhatti lohe ki mail door karti hai."
"7322","[AI-translation] Bukhar ko gaali na do, kyunke wo gunahon ko aise door karta hai jaise aag lohe ki mail door karti hai."
"7323","[AI-translation] Rizq ko jaldi na maango; kyunke koi banda marne se pehle apna aakhri rizq nahi pa leta; pas Allah se daro aur talab mein khoobi ikhtiyar karo: halal ko pakro aur haraam ko chhodo."
"7324","[AI-translation] Bazaar ke bahar ja kar qafilay ka istiqbal na karo, janwaron ke than na bandho, aur na tum mein se koi doosre ki kharidari par boli barhaye."
"7325","[AI-translation] Gooh aur haddiyon se istinja na karo, kyunke wo tumhare jinn bhaiyon ki ghiza hai."
"7326","[AI-translation] Dehat mein na raho, kyunke dehat mein rehne wala qabron mein rehne wale ki tarah hai."
"7327","[AI-translation] Yahud aur nasrani ki tarah salam na karo, kyunke un ka salam hatheliyon ke ishare se hota hai.. ..."
"7328","[AI-translation] Apne ghulam ka naam Rabah, Aflah, Yasar ya Najih na rakho; kaha jata hai: Kya wo maujood hai? to jawab diya jata hai: Nahi."
"7329","[AI-translation] Apne ghulam ka naam Rabah, Yasar, Aflah ya Nafi' na rakho."
"7330","[AI-translation] Angoor ko karm na kaho aur na kaho zamane ki khwari, kyunke Allah hi zamana hai."
"7331","[AI-translation] Use na kharido aur apne sadqe mein wapas na jao, agarche wo tumhe ek dirham mein de de; kyunke apne sadqe mein wapas jane wala apni qai mein wapas jane wale ki tarah hai."
"7332","[AI-translation] Safar sirf teen masjidon ki taraf kiya jaye: Masjid-e-Haram, meri ye Masjid aur Masjid-e-Aqsa."
"7333","[AI-translation] Koi nasha-awer cheez na piyo, kyunke main ne har nasha-awer cheez ko haraam kiya hai."
"7334","[AI-translation] Sharaab na piyo, kyunke wo har burai ki kunji hai."
"7335","[AI-translation] Sone aur chandi ke bartan mein na piyo, na un ki plates mein khao, na resham aur deebaj pehno; kyunke ye un ke liye duniya mein hai aur tumhare liye aakhirat mein."
"7336","[AI-translation] Kaddu ke bartan, raoghan lage bartan aur khajoor ki lakri ke bartan mein na piyo; mashkizon mein nabeedh banao; pas agar mashkizon mein shadeed ho jaye to us par pani daal do. Beshak Allah ne sharaab, jua, dhol aur har nasha-awer cheez ko haraam kiya hai."
"7337","[AI-translation] Naqeer, dabba aur hantam mein na piyo; tum par mokab mashk lazim hai."
"7338","[AI-translation] Naqeer, muzaffat, dabba aur hantam mein na piyo; balke aise mashk mein piyo jis ka munh bandha ho; pas agar shadeed ho jaye to use pani se tod do; agar phir bhi na ho to use baha do."
"7339","[AI-translation] Allah ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo, agarche tumhare jism ke tukde kar diye jayein aur jal diye jayein; aur jaan boojh kar koi farz namaz na chhodo; kyunke jis ne jaan boojh kar use chhoda us se zimma barri-uz-zimma ho gaya; aur sharaab na piyo kyunke wo har burai ki kunji hai."
"7340","[AI-translation] Na tattoo karo aur na tattoo karwao."
"7341","[AI-translation] Sirf momin se dosti rakho aur tumhara khana sirf parhezgar khaye."
"7342","[AI-translation] Farishte us qafile ke saath nahi chalte jis mein ghanti ho."
"7343","[AI-translation] Farishte us qafile ke saath nahi chalte jis mein jhunjhuna ho."
"7344","[AI-translation] Farishte us qafile ke saath nahi chalte jis mein kutta ya ghanti ho."
"7345","[AI-translation] Farishte us qafile ke saath nahi chalte jis mein cheetah ki khaal ho."
"7346","[AI-translation] Ahl-e-Kitab ki tasdeeq na karo aur na unhe jhutlao; balke kaho: Hum Allah par aur us par iman laye jo hamari taraf nazil kiya gaya; aayat."
"7347","[AI-translation] Oontniyon aur bakriyon ka doodh na roko; pas jo use is ke baad kharide wo doodh dohne ke baad do achhe vikalpon mein se achha chahe: chahe rakh le ya wo aur ek sa'a khajoor de kar wapas kar de."
"7348","[AI-translation] Kisi qabr ki taraf namaz na padho aur na qabr par namaz padho."
"7349","[AI-translation] Sote hue ya baat karte hue aadmi ke peeche namaz na padho."
"7350","[AI-translation] Ek namaz ek din mein do martaba na padho."
"7351","[AI-translation] Oont ke baithne ki jagah mein namaz na padho, kyunke wo shaitanon se hai; aur bakriyon ke baithne ki jagah mein namaz padho, kyunke wo barkat hai."
"7352","[AI-translation] Koi aurat apne shohar ke maujood hone mein us ki ijazat ke baghair roza na rakhe magar Ramzan; aur us ke ghar mein us ki ijazat ke baghair kisi ko aane ki ijazat na de; aur jo us ki kamai se us ke hukm ke baghair kharch kare to us ka aadha ajr use milega."
"7353","[AI-translation] Chand dekhne tak roza na rakho aur chand dekhne tak iftar na karo; agar tum par badal chha jaye to ginti poori karo."
"7354","[AI-translation] Ramzan se pehle roza na rakho; chand dekh kar roza rakho aur chand dekh kar iftar karo; agar us ke aage badal ho jaye to tees din poore karo."
"7355","[AI-translation] In dinon - Ayyam-e-Tashreeq - roza na rakho, kyunke ye khane peene ke din hain."
"7356","[AI-translation] Jumma ke din roza na rakho magar is ke pehle ya baad ek din ho."
"7357","[AI-translation] Jumma ke din akela roza na rakho."
"7358","[AI-translation] Hafta ke din roza na rakho magar farz roza; aur agar tum mein se kisi ko angoor ki lakri ya ped ki chhaal ke siwa kuch na mile to usi se iftar kar le."
"7359","[AI-translation] Koi aurat apne shohar ki ijazat ke baghair roza na rakhe."
"7360","[AI-translation] Allah ki aurton ko na maaro."
"7361","[AI-translation] Mushrikeen ki handiyon mein na pakao; agar us ke siwa koi aur na mile to unhe achhi tarah dho kar phir pakao aur khao."
"7362","[AI-translation] Raat ko aurton ke paas achanak na jao."
"7363","[AI-translation] Mujhe aise na badhao jaise nasraniyon ne Ibn Maryam ko badhaya; main sirf banda hoon, pas kaho: Allah ka banda aur us ka Rasool."
"7364","[AI-translation] Miskeenon ko wo cheez na khilao jo tum khud nahi khate."
"7365","[AI-translation] Ek din mein namaz do martaba na padho."
"7366","[AI-translation] Kisi amal karne wale ke amal par khush na ho yahan tak ke dekho us ka anjaam kya hota hai."
"7367","[AI-translation] Allah ke azab se azab na do."
"7368","[AI-translation] Apne bachchon ko gale ki beemari mein dabaa kar na satao; tum par qust ka ilaaj lazim hai."
"7369","[AI-translation] Das kodon se zyada tazeer na karo."
"7370","[AI-translation] Ilm is liye na seekho ke ulama par fakhr karo ya bewaqoofon se jhagda karo, aur na is liye ke majlison mein tumhari dhaak bane; pas jis ne aisa kiya to us ke liye aag aag hai."
"7371","[AI-translation] Sawari par safar sirf teen masjidon ki taraf karo: Masjid-e-Haram, meri ye Masjid aur Bait-ul-Maqdis."
"7372","[AI-translation] Aaj ke baad qayamat tak Makkah par hamla nahi kiya jayega."
"7373","[AI-translation] Ghusse mein na aa."
"7374","[AI-translation] Ghusse mein na aa, tumhare liye jannat hai."
"7375","[AI-translation] Aaraab tumhari namaz ke naam Isha par ghalib na aa jayein; kyunke Allah ki kitab mein wo Isha hai aur wo oontniyon ke doodh dohne ki der tak use Atmah kahte hain."
"7376","[AI-translation] Aaraab tumhari namaz ke naam par ghalib na aa jayein; wo to Isha hai, wo to kahte hain Atmah apne oonton ko der tak dohne ki wajah se."
"7377","[AI-translation] Allah ke nabiyon ke darmiyan fazeelat na do; kyunke soor phoonka jayega to aasman aur zameen mein jo hain be-hosh ho jayenge siwaye jise Allah chahe; phir doosri baar phoonka jayega to main sab se pehle uthaya jaunga; phir Musa Arsh ko pakre hue honge; mujhe maloom nahi ke unhe Tur ke din ki be-hoshi ka hisab diya gaya ya mujh se pehle uthaye gaye; aur main ye nahi kahta ke koi Yunus bin Matta se afzal hai."
"7378","[AI-translation] Aisa na karo; pehle sab ko dirhamon ke badle becho, phir dirhamon se janeeb kharido."
"7379","[AI-translation] Aisa na karo, kyunke tum mein se kisi ka Allah ki raah mein khara rehna us ke ghar mein sattar saal namaz padhne se behtar hai. Kya tum ye nahi chahte ke Allah tumhe maaf kare aur jannat mein dakhil kare? Allah ki raah mein jihad karo; jo Allah ki raah mein larta hai, ek oontni ka doodh dohne ke barabar waqt ke liye, us ke liye jannat wajib ho jati hai."
"7380","[AI-translation] Fars ke badshahon ke saath jo sulook un ke sardaron ke saath hota hai waisa na karo."
"7381","[AI-translation] Masjidon mein hadd qaim na ki jaye aur na baap bete ke badle qatl kiya jaye."
"7382","[AI-translation] Tum mein se kisi ki namaz qubool nahi hoti jab wo hadas kar baithe yahan tak ke wuzu kar le."
"7383","[AI-translation] Haiz wali aurat ki namaz baghair sar dhakne ke qubool nahi hoti."
"7384","[AI-translation] Baghair taharat ke namaz qubool nahi hoti aur na ghanimat mein khayanat se diya gaya sadqa."
"7385","[AI-translation] Us aurat ki namaz qubool nahi hoti jo is masjid ke liye khushbu lagaye yahan tak ke wo wapas ja kar janabat ke ghusl ki tarah ghusl kare."
"7386","[AI-translation] Meri aulad ek dinar bhi taqseem na kare; jo main ne apni biwiyon ke kharch aur apne aamil ke kharche ke baad chhoda wo sadqa hai."
"7387","[AI-translation] Koi jaan zulm se qatl nahi hoti magar us ke khoon ka bojh Ibn Adam ke pehle bete par hota hai, kyunke wo pehla qatl karne wala hai."
"7388","[AI-translation] Tiddiyon ko na maaro, kyunke wo Allah ka sab se bada lashkar hai."
"7389","[AI-translation] Saanp ko na maaro magar har us dam-burida do dhari wale ko jo bachcha girata hai aur nazar kharab karta hai, to use maaro."
"7390","[AI-translation] Mendhak ko na maaro ... ..."
"7391","[AI-translation] Apni aulad ko chupke se na maaro; qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, beshak ghail sawar ko pakad leta hai aur use us ke ghore se gira deta hai."
"7392","[AI-translation] Ramzan se ek ya do din pehle roza na rakho, magar ye ke wo aisa roza ho jo tum mein se koi pehle se rakhta ho. Chand dekhne tak roza na rakho, phir chand dekhne tak roza rakho; agar badal ho jaye to tees din poore karo, phir iftar karo; aur mahina untees ka bhi hota hai."
"7393","[AI-translation] Ramzan se ek ya do din pehle roza na rakho, magar ye ke wo us roza se mil jaye jo tum mein se koi pehle se rakhta ho. Chand dekh kar roza rakho aur chand dekh kar iftar karo; agar tum par badal chha jaye to tees ki ginti karo, phir iftar karo."
"7394","[AI-translation] Mahina shuru na karo yahan tak ke chand dekho ya pehle ginti poore karo; phir roza rakho yahan tak ke chand dekho ya pehle ginti poore karo."
"7395","[AI-translation] Ramzan se ek ya do din pehle roza na rakho, magar ye ke aadmi pehle se koi roza rakhta ho to wo rakhe."
"7396","[AI-translation] Khwab sirf aalim ya khair-khwah ko sunao."
"7397","[AI-translation] Safar mein haath nahi kaate jayenge."
"7398","[AI-translation] Latki hui khajoor mein haath na kaato; pas agar use khalyan ne jama kar liya to dhaal ki qeemat par haath kata jayega; aur pahad ki charai mein haath na kaato; pas jab janwar apne baithne ki jagah aa jaye to dhaal ki qeemat par haath kata jayega."
"7399","[AI-translation] Chor ka haath nahi kaata jayega magar chauthai dinar ya us se zyada par."
"7400","[AI-translation] Qabron par na baitho."
"7401","[AI-translation] Shaitan ko ta's na kaho, kyunke wo bara ho kar ghar jaisa ho jata hai aur kahta hai: Meri taqat se wo gira. Balke kaho: Bismillah; kyunke jab tum aisa kahoge to wo chhota ho kar makkhi jaisa ho jayega."
"7402","[AI-translation] Yun na kaho: Alaikas-salam; kyunke alaikas-salam murdon ki dua hai; balke kaho: As-salamu alaika."
"7403","[AI-translation] Allah par salam na bhejo, kyunke Allah hi Salam hai; balke kaho: At-tahiyyatu lillahi was-salawaatu wat-tayyibaat, as-salamu alaika ayyuhan-Nabiyyu wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh, as-salamu alaina wa ala ibadillahis-saliheen. Pas jab tum aisa kahoge to ye har us bande ko pahunchega jo aasman aur zameen mein hai. Ash-hadu an la ilaha illallah wa ash-hadu anna Muhammadan abduhu wa rasooluh. Phir dua mein se jo use zyada pasand ho wo maange."
"7404","[AI-translation] Karm na kaho balke angoor aur hablah kaho."
"7405","[AI-translation] Munafiq ko hamare sardar na kaho; kyunke agar wo tumhara sardar ho to tum ne apne Rab ko naraaz kar diya."
"7406","[AI-translation] Yun na kaho: Jo Allah ne chaha aur falane ne chaha; balke kaho: Jo Allah ne chaha, phir falane ne chaha."
"7407","[AI-translation] Qayamat sirf bad-tareen logon par qaim hogi."
"7408","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke meri ummat pichli ummaton ki pairwi karegi: baalisht baalisht aur zara ba zara. Kaha gaya: Ae Allah ke Rasool, Fars aur Rum ki tarah? Farmaya: Un ke siwa aur kaun log hain?"
"7409","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke Hijaz ki zameen se aag niklegi jo Busra mein oonton ki gardanein roshan kar degi."
"7410","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke Daus qabile ki dumbelein Zul-Khalasa ke gird naachne lagengi."
"7411","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke sooraj maghrib se nikle; pas jab wo niklega aur log use dekhenge to sab iman le aayenge, lekin wo waqt hoga jab kisi jaan ko us ka iman faida nahi dega jo pehle se iman na laya ho ya iman ki halat mein neki na ki ho. Aur qayamat us waqt qaim hogi jab do aadmi kapda apne darmiyan phaila kar bech rahe honge, na wo bech sakenge na lapet sakenge; qayamat us waqt qaim hogi jab aadmi apni oontni ka doodh le kar wapas hua hoga aur use pi na sakega; qayamat us waqt qaim hogi jab wo apna hauz laga raha hoga aur us mein pani na de sakega; qayamat us waqt qaim hogi jab wo apna luqma munh tak utha chuka hoga aur use kha na sakega."
"7412","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke sooraj maghrib se nikle; pas jab wo maghrib se niklega aur log use dekhenge to sab iman le aayenge, lekin wo waqt hoga jab kisi jaan ko us ka iman faida nahi dega jo pehle se iman na laya ho."
"7413","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke tum Turk se laro: chhoti aankhon, surkh chehre, chapti naak wale, goya un ke chehre thepe hue dhaal hain; aur qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke tum aise logon se laro jin ke joote baalon ke hain. Aur tum mein se kisi par aisa zamana aayega ke mujhe dekhna us ke liye us ke ahl-o-maal jaisa hone se zyada pyara hoga."
"7414","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke tum yahudion se laro; yahan tak ke patthar kahega jis ke peeche yahudi hoga: Ae musalman! Ye yahudi mere peeche hai, aa kar use qatl kar."
"7415","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke tum Khuz aur Kirman se laro jo Ajam mein se hain: surkh chehre, chapti naak, chhoti aankhen, goya un ke chehre thepe hue dhaal hain, un ke joote baalon ke hain."
"7416","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke tum aise logon se laro jo chhoti aankhon aur chaura chaura chehre wale hain, goya un ki aankhein tiddiyon ki aankhein hain, goya un ke chehre thepe hue dhaal hain; wo baal ke joote pehnte hain aur dhaal banate hain, yahan tak ke wo apne ghore khajoor ke darakhton se bandhte hain."
"7417","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke do bade giroh larenge, un ka dawa ek hi hoga; aur qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke tees ke qareeb jhoote dajjal bheje jayenge, un mein se har ek kahega ke main Allah ka Rasool hoon."
"7418","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke meri ummat ke qabile mushrikeen se mil jayenge aur buton ki ibadat karenge; aur meri ummat mein tees jhoote honge, un mein se har ek kahega ke main nabi hoon; aur main nabiyon ka khatim hoon, mere baad koi nabi nahi."
"7419","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke Baitullah ka hajj chhut jayega."
"7420","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke zameen par Allah Allah nahi kaha jayega."
"7421","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke log masjidon par fakhr karenge."
"7422","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke zamana qareeb ho jayega: saal mahine jaisa, mahina Jumma jaisa, Jumma din jaisa, din lamhe jaisa aur lamha aag ke shole jaisa ho jayega."
"7423","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke Farat sone ka pahad ugal dega jis par log larenge; har sau mein se ninyanwe qatl honge aur un mein se har aadmi kahega: Shayad main hi bachne wala hoon."
"7424","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke Farat sone ka pahad ugal dega jis par log larenge aur un ki nau dasaiyan qatl hongi."
"7425","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke Qahtan se ek aadmi niklega jo logon ko apni lathi se hankega."
"7426","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke musalman Turk se larenge: aise log jinke chehre thepe hue dhaal jaise hain, baal pehnte hain aur baalon mein chalte hain."
"7427","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke musalman yahudion se larenge aur unhe qatl karenge; yahan tak ke yahudi patthar aur ped ke peeche chhup jayega to patthar ya ped kahega: Ae musalman! Ae Allah ke bande! Ye yahudi mere peeche hai, aa kar use qatl kar; magar Gharqad, kyunke wo yahudion ka ped hai."
"7428","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke ilm qabz kar liya jayega, zalze zyada honge, zamana qareeb hoga, fitne zahir honge aur harj zyada hoga; aur harj qatl hai."
"7429","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke maal zyada ho kar bah jayega; yahan tak ke aadmi apne maal ki zakat le kar niklega to koi use qubool karne wala na milega; aur yahan tak ke Arab ki zameen sabza-zar aur nadiyon wali ho jayegi."
"7430","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke tum mein maal zyada ho kar bah jayega; yahan tak ke maal ka malik sochega ke us ka sadqa kaun qubool karega; aur use lekar kisi ke saamne pesh karega to wo kahega: Mujhe is ki zaroorat nahi."
"7431","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke duniya mein sab se zyada khush-naseeb Laqe' bin Laqe' hoga."
"7432","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke aadmi doosre aadmi ki qabr par guzrega aur kahega: Kaash main us ki jagah hota."
"7433","[AI-translation] Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke Rum Amq ya Dabiq mein utrenge; pas un ke muqable mein Madina se ek lashkar niklega jo us waqt zameen walon mein sab se behtar honge. Jab do lashkarein samne aayengi to Rum kahenge: Hamare aur un logon ke darmiyan se hat jao jo hamare qaidi hue hain, hum un se larenge. Musalman kahenge: Nahi, Allah ki qasam, hum tumhare aur hamare bhaiyon ke darmiyan nahi hategae. Phir wo un se larenge; ek tihai bhaag jayegi jis par Allah kabhi tauba na karega; ek tihai qatl hogi aur wo Allah ke haan behtareen shaheed honge; aur ek tihai fateh payegi, unhe kabhi fitna nahi hoga. Phir wo Qustuntuniya fateh karenge. Jab wo ghanimat taqseem kar rahe honge aur apni talwaren zaitoon ke darakhton par latka chuke honge, to shaitan un ke darmiyan cheekh marega: Masih tumhare peeche tumhare ghar walon mein aa chuka hai. Wo niklengi, aur ye baat baatil hai. Phir jab wo Sham aayenge to wo bhi niklega. Jab wo lardai ki tayyari kar rahe honge aur safein seedhi kar rahe honge, to namaz ki iqamat hogi, Isa bin Maryam nazil honge aur un ki imamat karenge. Pas Allah ka dushman unhe dekh kar aise pighal jayega jaise namak pani mein pighalta hai; agar wo unhe chhod de to wo pighal kar halak ho jaye, lekin Allah apne haath se use qatl karega aur unhe apne neze par us ka khoon dikhayega."
"7434","[AI-translation] Mujh se Quran ke siwa kuch na likho; jis ne Quran ke siwa kuch likha wo use mita de; mujh se hadees bayan karo, koi haraj nahi; aur jis ne jaan boojh kar mujh par jhoot bana diya wo apna thikana aag mein bana le."
"7435","[AI-translation] Zyada mat hanso, kyunke zyada hansna dil ko murda kar deta hai."
"7436","[AI-translation] Mujh par jhoot na bolo, kyunke jhoot aag tak pahunchata hai."
"7437","[AI-translation] Mujh par jhoot na bolo, kyunke jis ne mujh par jhoot bola wo aag mein dakhil hoga."
"7438","[AI-translation] Zameen ko kiraye par na do.. ..."
"7439","[AI-translation] Apne beemaron ko khane peene par majboor na karo, kyunke Allah unhe khilata aur pilata hai."
"7440","[AI-translation] Apni raan na kholo aur na kisi zinda ya murda ki raan ko dekho."
"7441","[AI-translation] Mehman ke liye takalluf na karo."
"7442","[AI-translation] Apne bhai ke khilaf shaitan ke madadgar na bano."
"7443","[AI-translation] Allah ki laanat, us ke ghusse ya aag ki laanat se ek doosre ko laanat na do."
"7444","[AI-translation] Resham na pehno, kyunke jis ne duniya mein use pehna wo aakhirat mein nahi pehnega."
"7445","[AI-translation] Qamees, amaam, shalwar, topi wala libas aur moze na pehno, magar jo joote na paye wo moze pehne aur unhe takhno se neeche kaat de; aur aisa kapda na pehno jis mein za'faran ya wars laga ho; aur ihram wali aurat na naqab pehne aur na dastane."
"7446","[AI-translation] Sawal mein israr na karo; Allah ki qasam! Tum mein se koi mujh se koi cheez maange aur us ki zid se wo cheez mujh se nikle aur main use na chahun, to jo main ne diya us mein barkat daal di jayegi."
"7447","[AI-translation] Hawa ko laanat na do, kyunke wo hukm ki paband hai; aur jo kisi aisi cheez ko laanat de jo us ki ahl na ho to wo laanat usi par palat aati hai."
"7448","[AI-translation] Qafilay ko bazaar ke bahar na ja kar milo; pas jo us se mil kar kuch kharide to us ka asal malik bazaar aane par ikhtiyar rakhta hai."
"7449","[AI-translation] Qafilay ko bechne ke liye na milo, na ek doosre ki bechai par bechai karo, na najash karo, na koi shahri dehati ki taraf se beche, na bakriyon ka doodh roko. Pas jo use kharide wo doodh dohne ke baad do achhe vikalpon ka ikhtiyar rakhta hai: agar raazi ho to rakh le, aur agar naraaz ho to wapas kar de aur ek sa'a khajoor de."
"7450","[AI-translation] Qafilay ko na milo aur na koi shahri dehati ki taraf se beche."
"7451","[AI-translation] Janwaron ko masla na karo."
"7452","[AI-translation] Namaz padhte hue kankariyan mat hatao; agar karna hi ho to ek martaba - kankariyan baraabar karna."
"7453","[AI-translation] Ek joote mein na chalo, ek kapde mein lipt kar na baithe, baayein haath se na khao, aisi chadar na lapeto jis mein haath bahar na aayein, aur let kar ek pair doosre par na rakho."
"7454","[AI-translation] Aurton ko masjidon mein un ka hissa na roko jab wo tum se ijazat maangein."
"7455","[AI-translation] Allah ki laundiyon ko masjid mein namaz padhne se na roko."
"7456","[AI-translation] Allah ki laundiyon ko Allah ki masjidon se na roko."
"7457","[AI-translation] Allah ki laundiyon ko Allah ki masjidon se na roko, lekin wo khushbu lagaye baghair niklein."
"7458","[AI-translation] Apni aurton ko masjidon se na roko, aur un ke gharon mein un ke liye behtar hai."
"7459","[AI-translation] Khajoor aur kachchi khajoor ko mila kar nabeedh na banao; har ek ko alag alag banao."
"7460","[AI-translation] Kaddu ke bartan aur raoghan lage bartan mein nabeedh na banao."
"7461","[AI-translation] Puqli aur taza khajoor ko mila kar nabeedh na banao, aur khajoor aur kishmish ko mila kar nabeedh na banao; har ek ko alag alag banao."
"7462","[AI-translation] Kaddu, raoghan lage bartan aur naqeer mein nabeedh na banao; aur har nasha-awer cheez haraam hai."
"7463","[AI-translation] Safed baal na ukhaado; koi musalman Islam mein safed baal laayega to qayamat ke din wo us ke liye noor hoga."
"7464","[AI-translation] Is Ghar par hamla karne ke lashkar khatam nahi honge yahan tak ke un mein se ek lashkar zameen mein dhans jayega."
"7465","[AI-translation] Log is Ghar par hamla karne se baaz nahi aayenge yahan tak ke ek lashkar hamla karega; pas jab wo Baida ya zameen ke kisi bayaban mein honge to un ke pehle aur aakhri log zameen mein dhans jayenge aur un ka beech wala bhi najaat nahi payega. Kaha gaya: Agar un mein koi majboor shakhs ho? Farmaya: Allah unhe un ki niyaton ke mutabiq uthayega."
"7466","[AI-translation] Nazar na maano, kyunke nazar taqdeer ko kuch nahi badalti, wo to sirf kanjoos se maal nikalwati hai."
"7467","[AI-translation] Reham sirf bad-naseeb se chhinta hai."
"7468","[AI-translation] Sadak ke kinare par na utro aur na wahan qazaa-e-haajat karo."
"7469","[AI-translation] Hijrat khatam nahi hogi yahan tak ke tauba khatam ho jaye; aur tauba khatam nahi hogi yahan tak ke sooraj maghrib se nikal aaye."
"7470","[AI-translation] Kisi ayyam se us ki ijazat ke baghair nikah na karo, aur na kisi bikr se us ki ijazat ke baghair nikah karo. Kaha gaya: Us ki ijazat kaise? Farmaya: Ke wo chup rahe."
"7471","[AI-translation] Bewa se us ki ijazat ke baghair nikah na karo aur na bikr se us ki ijazat ke baghair nikah karo; aur us ki ijazat chup rehna hai."
"7472","[AI-translation] Bhai ki beti par phuphi ka nikah na karo aur na behan ki beti par khala ka."
"7473","[AI-translation] Kisi aurat se us ki phuphi ke saath nikah na karo, na phuphi se bhai ki beti ke saath, na aurat se khala ke saath, na khala se behan ki beti ke saath; na bari se chhoti ke saath, na chhoti se bari ke saath."
"7474","[AI-translation] Kisi aurat se us ki phuphi ya khala ke saath nikah na karo."
"7475","[AI-translation] Had se zyada na kaato; beshak ye aurat ke liye zyada behtar aur shohar ke liye zyada pasandida hai."
"7476","[AI-translation] Wisal na karo; main tum mein se kisi ki tarah nahi hoon; mujhe khilaya aur pilaya jata hai."
"7477","[AI-translation] Wisal na karo; pas tum mein se jo wisal karna chahe to sehri tak kare; main tumhari tarah nahi hoon; main raat basata hoon, mujhe khilane wala khilata hai aur pilane wala pilata hai."
"7478","[AI-translation] Namaz ko namaz se na jodo yahan tak ke tum koi baat karo ya ghar se nikal jao."
"7479","[AI-translation] Hamla aurat se humbistari na karo yahan tak ke wo bachcha paida kar de, aur na ghair-hamla se yahan tak ke wo haiz kar le."
"7480","[AI-translation] Tum sadqa band na karo ke Allah tum par band kar de; jitna kar sako thoda thoda do."
"7481","[AI-translation] Tum band na karo ke Allah tum par band kar de."
"7482","[AI-translation] Aapas mein qata-talliq na karo, pith peeche burai na karo, jasoosi na karo, aur ek doosre ki bechai par bechai na karo; Allah ke bande bhai bhai ban jao."
"7483","[AI-translation] Race mein jalb aur janb nahi."
"7484","[AI-translation] Jalb aur janb nahi, aur un ke sadqat un ke gharon hi mein liye jayenge."
"7485","[AI-translation] Islam mein jalb, janb aur shighar nahi."
"7486","[AI-translation] Islam mein jalb, janb aur shighar nahi; aur jis ne loot machai wo hum mein se nahi."
"7487","[AI-translation] Hasad sirf do cheezon mein jaiz hai: us aadmi par jo Allah ne Quran ata kiya aur wo raat din ke hisson mein use padhta hai; aur us aadmi par jo Allah ne maal ata kiya aur wo raat din ke hisson mein use Allah ki raah mein kharch karta hai."
"7488","[AI-translation] Hasad sirf do cheezon mein: us aadmi par jise Allah ne maal diya aur use haq ki raah mein kharch karne ka ikhtiyar diya; aur us aadmi par jise Allah ne hikmat di, wo us se faisla karta hai aur use sikhata hai."
"7489","[AI-translation] Hasad sirf do cheezon mein: us aadmi par jise Allah ne Quran sikhaya aur wo raat din ke hisson mein use padhta hai; pas us ke padosi ne suna to kaha: Kaash mujhe bhi wohi mila hota jo falane ko mila hai aur main bhi wohi karta jo wo karta hai; aur us aadmi par jise Allah ne maal diya aur wo use haq ki raah mein kharch karta hai, to ek aadmi ne kaha: Kaash mujhe bhi wohi mila hota jo falane ko mila hai aur main bhi wohi karta jo wo karta hai."
"7490","[AI-translation] Islam mein naya halaf nahi hai; aur jahiliyat ka jo halaf tha use Islam ne sirf mazboot kiya."
"7491","[AI-translation] Hima sirf Allah aur us ke Rasool ke liye hai."
"7492","[AI-translation] Us shakhs mein koi khair nahi jo mehman ki khidmat na kare."
"7493","[AI-translation] Islam mein nasab ka dawa nahi; jahiliyat ka maamla ja chuka. Aulad bistar wale ki hai aur zina karne wale ke liye patthar."
"7494","[AI-translation] Udhar us mein nahi jo haath ba haath ho."
"7495","[AI-translation] Doodh ki hurmat sirf us se hai jo aant khol de."
"7496","[AI-translation] Jhaad sirf nazar, danke ke zeher ya khoon ke liye hai."
"7497","[AI-translation] Maal par zakat nahi hai yahan tak ke us par saal guzar jaye."
"7498","[AI-translation] Inaam ki shart sirf sum wale janwar ya teer mein hai."
"7499","[AI-translation] Raat ko baat-cheet sirf namaz padhne wale ya musafir ke liye jaiz hai."
"7500","[AI-translation] Koi shugoon-e-bad nahi; aur barkat ghar, aurat aur ghore mein ho sakti hai."
"7501","[AI-translation] Islam mein shighar nahi."
"7502","[AI-translation] Allah taala se zyada ghairatmand koi nahi."
"7503","[AI-translation] ......... Nazar haq hai aur tireh mein sab se sachcha fa'l hai."
"7504","[AI-translation] Ek sa'a khajoor ke badle do sa'a nahi aur ek sa'a gandum ke badle do sa'a nahi aur ek dirham ke badle do dirham nahi."
"7505","[AI-translation] Do sa'a ke badle ek sa'a nahi aur do dirham ke badle ek dirham nahi."
"7506","[AI-translation] Us ka roza nahi jo hamesha roza rakhe."
"7507","[AI-translation] Jis ne hamesha roza rakha us ne roza nahi rakha; teen din ka roza poore zamane ka roza hai."
"7508","[AI-translation] Daud ke roze se badh kar koi roza nahi: aadha zamana; ek din roza, ek din iftar."
"7509","[AI-translation] Khane ke maujood hone mein namaz nahi, aur na us waqt jab peshab-o-paikhana zor kare."
"7510","[AI-translation] Fajr ke baad namaz nahi yahan tak ke sooraj buland ho jaye, aur Asr ke baad namaz nahi yahan tak ke sooraj doob jaye."
"7511","[AI-translation] Fajr ke baad koi namaz nahi magar do rakat."
"7512","[AI-translation] Us ki namaz nahi jo Umm-ul-Quran ya us se zyada na padhe."
"7513","[AI-translation] Us ki namaz nahi jo Fateha na padhe."
"7514","[AI-translation] Us ki namaz nahi jis ka wuzu nahi, aur us ka wuzu nahi jis ne Allah ka naam nahi liya."
"7515","[AI-translation] Us ki namaz nahi jis ka wuzu nahi, aur us ka wuzu nahi jis ne Allah ka naam nahi liya ... ..."
"7516","[AI-translation] Us ka roza nahi jo raat hi se roze ka irada na kare."
"7517","[AI-translation] Na nuqsan pahunchana hai na nuqsan sahna."
"7518","[AI-translation] Ameen par koi zima-dari nahi."
"7519","[AI-translation] Allah ki nafarmani mein kisi ki ita'at nahi; ita'at sirf neki mein hai."
"7520","[AI-translation] Khaliq ki nafarmani mein makhlooq ki ita'at nahi."
"7521","[AI-translation] Us ki ita'at nahi jis ne Allah ki ita'at nahi ki."
"7522","[AI-translation] Talaq sirf us cheez par jo malik mein ho, na azadi sirf us par jo malik mein ho, na bechai sirf us par jo malik mein ho, na nazar ki wafai sirf us par jo malik mein ho; aur nazar sirf us cheez ki jo Allah ki raza ke liye ho. Jis ne gunah ki qasam khai us ki qasam nahi, aur jis ne qata-talliq ki qasam khai us ki qasam nahi."
"7523","[AI-translation] Nikah se pehle talaq nahi."
"7524","[AI-translation] Nikah se pehle talaq nahi aur milkiyat se pehle azadi nahi."
"7525","[AI-translation] Majboori ki halat mein talaq aur azadi nahi."
"7526","[AI-translation] Tireh nahi; us ki bhalai fa'l hai - wo achha kalma jo tum mein se koi sune."
"7527","[AI-translation] Koi adwa nahi, na safar, na hama."
"7528","[AI-translation] Koi adwa nahi aur na tireh; lekin shugoon-e-bad teen cheezon mein hai: ghore, aurat aur ghar."
"7529","[AI-translation] Koi adwa nahi, na tireh, na hama.... to kis ne pehle ko khujli lagai?"
"7530","[AI-translation] Koi adwa nahi, na tireh, na hama, na safar; aur kodhi se aise bhaago jaise sher se bhaagte ho."
"7531","[AI-translation] Koi adwa nahi, na tireh, na hama, na safar, na ghoul."
"7532","[AI-translation] Koi adwa nahi aur na tireh; aur mujhe achha fa'l pasand hai; aur achha fa'l achha kalma hai."
"7533","[AI-translation] Koi adwa nahi, na hama, na tireh; aur mujhe achha fa'l pasand hai."
"7534","[AI-translation] Koi adwa nahi, na hama, na nau', na safar."
"7535","[AI-translation] Islam mein aqar nahi."
"7536","[AI-translation] Allah ki haddon mein se kisi hadd ke siwa das kodon se zyada saza nahi."
"7537","[AI-translation] Tumhare na karne mein koi haraj nahi; beshak Allah ne likh diya hai jo qayamat tak paida hone wala hai."
"7538","[AI-translation] Tumhare na karne mein koi haraj nahi; Allah ne likh diya hai ke koi jaan qayamat tak paida hone wali nahi magar wo zaroor hogi."
"7539","[AI-translation] Umra nahi; pas jis ne kisi cheez ka umra kiya to wo us ki hai."
"7540","[AI-translation] Na umra na ruqba; pas jis ne kisi cheez ka umra ya ruqba kiya to wo us ki hai, us ki zindagi aur maut mein."
"7541","[AI-translation] Namaz aur salam mein koi kami nahi."
"7542","[AI-translation] Ghasb aur loot nahi."
"7543","[AI-translation] Koi ghoul nahi."
"7544","[AI-translation] Koi fara' aur atira nahi."
"7545","[AI-translation] Phal ki chori par haath nahi kaata jayega aur na khajoor ke gudde par."
"7546","[AI-translation] Allah ki nafarmani ki nazar nahi, aur na us cheez ki nazar jo Ibn Adam ki milkiyat mein nahi."
"7547","[AI-translation] Nafarmani ki nazar nahi aur us ka kaffara qasam ka kaffara hai."
"7548","[AI-translation] Ibn Adam ke liye us cheez ki nazar nahi jo us ki milkiyat mein nahi, na us cheez ki qasam jis ka wo malik nahi, na us cheez ki talaq jis ka wo malik nahi."
"7549","[AI-translation] Nazar aur qasam us cheez mein nahi jo Ibn Adam ki milkiyat mein nahi, na Allah ki nafarmani mein, na qata-talliq mein ... ..."
"7550","[AI-translation] Tumhare liye koi nafqa nahi magar ye ke tum haamla ho."
"7551","[AI-translation] Tumhare liye na nafqa hai na rehaish."
"7552","[AI-translation] Khums ke baad hi nafl hai."
"7553","[AI-translation] Hum Abtah ko sirf daud kar paar karte hain."
"7554","[AI-translation] Hum wadi ko sirf daud kar paar karte hain."
"7555","[AI-translation] Nikah sirf wali ke saath hai."
"7556","[AI-translation] Nikah sirf wali ke saath hai; aur sultan us ka wali hai jis ka koi wali nahi."
"7557","[AI-translation] Nikah sirf wali aur do aadil gawahon ke saath hai."
"7558","[AI-translation] Nikah sirf wali aur do gawahon ke saath hai."
"7559","[AI-translation] Hum ambiya ka tarka warasat mein nahi milta; jo hum chhod gaye wo sadqa hai."
"7560","[AI-translation] Hum ambiya ka tarka warasat mein nahi milta; jo hum chhodein wo sadqa hai; beshak Aal-e-Muhammad is maal mein se khate hain."
"7561","[AI-translation] Hum ambiya ka tarka warasat nahi milta; wo sadqa hai; aur ye maal Aal-e-Muhammad ke liye un ki zaroorat aur un ke mehman ke liye hai; pas jab main mar jaun to ye mere baad wali-ul-amr ke paas hoga."
"7562","[AI-translation] Na hama, na adwa, na tireh; aur agar tireh kisi cheez mein ho to ghore, aurat aur ghar mein."
"7563","[AI-translation] Fatah ke baad hijrat nahi, lekin jihad aur niyat hai; aur jab tumhe bulaya jaye to niklo."
"7564","[AI-translation] Teen din ke baad hijrat nahi."
"7565","[AI-translation] Fatah-e-Makkah ke baad hijrat nahi."
"7566","[AI-translation] Hijrat nahi, lekin jihad aur niyat hai; aur jab tumhe bulaya jaye to niklo. Beshak ye shehar Allah ne us din haram kiya jis din aasman aur zameen paida kiye, aur wo qayamat tak Allah ki hurmat se haram hai; aur mujh se pehle kisi ke liye is mein lardai halal nahi hui aur mere liye bhi din ke ek sa'at ke siwa halal nahi hui; pas wo qayamat tak Allah ki hurmat se haram hai; is ki kaant na kaati jaye, na is ka shikar bhagaya jaye, na is ki giri hui cheez uthai jaye magar wo jo use pehchan le, aur is ki ghaas na kaati jaye magar izkhar."
"7567","[AI-translation] Ek raat mein do witr nahi."
"7568","[AI-translation] Tumhe na mile, tumhe na mile, tumhe na mile! Ye masjidein sirf usi maqsad ke liye banayi gayi hain jis ke liye banayi gayi."
"7569","[AI-translation] Roze mein wisal nahi."
"7570","[AI-translation] Waris ke liye wasiyat nahi."
"7571","[AI-translation] Wuzu sirf hawa nikalne ya us ki awaaz sunne se tootta hai."
"7572","[AI-translation] Wuzu sirf awaaz ya hawa se tootta hai."
"7573","[AI-translation] Us ka wuzu nahi jis ne Allah ka naam nahi liya."
"7574","[AI-translation] Allah ki nafarmani ki nazar ki wafai nahi."
"7575","[AI-translation] Jo aadmi apne maalik ke paas aata hai aur us se us ka fazal maangta hai jo us ke paas hai aur wo use mana kar deta hai, to qayamat ke din us ke liye ek ganja saanp laya jayega jo apne hont chalta hoga, us fazal ki wajah se jo us ne mana kiya."
"7576","[AI-translation] Tum par koi saal ya din nahi aata magar us ke baad wala us se bada hota hai yahan tak ke tum apne Rab se muloqat karo."
"7577","[AI-translation] Koi aadmi zameen ka ek balisht bhi na le jo us ka haq nahi, magar Allah qayamat ke din use saat zameenon tak ka tauq pehna dega."
"7578","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi apne saathi ka saaman mazaq mein ya sach mein na le; agar us ne apne saathi ki lathi li ho to wo use wapas kar de."
"7579","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi baayein haath se na khaye aur na piye, kyunke shaitan baayein haath se khata aur peeta hai."
"7580","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi apni qurbani ka gosht teen din se zyada na khaye."
"7581","[AI-translation] Aadmi apni sultanat mein kisi ki imamat na kare, aur us ke ghar mein us ki takrim ki jagah par us ki ijazat ke baghair na baithe."
"7582","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi momin nahi hoga jab tak main use us ki aulad, us ke baap aur tamam logon se zyada pyara na ho jaun."
"7583","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi momin nahi hoga jab tak apne bhai ke liye wohi na chaahe jo apne liye chahta hai."
"7584","[AI-translation] Koi banda momin nahi hoga jab tak chaar cheezon par iman na laye: wo gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur main Allah ka Rasool hoon, mujhe haq ke saath bheja gaya; maut par iman laye; maut ke baad uthne par iman laye; aur qadr par iman laye, us ki bhalai aur burai."
"7585","[AI-translation] Koi banda momin nahi hoga jab tak qadr par iman na laye, us ki bhalai aur burai; yahan tak ke wo jaan le ke jo use pahunchna tha wo use chhod nahi sakta tha aur jo use nahi pahunchna tha wo use mil nahi sakta tha."
"7586","[AI-translation] Fazal pani becha nahi jayega taake us se ghaas bechi jaye."
"7587","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi apne bhai ki bechai par bechai na kare."
"7588","[AI-translation] Aadmi apne bhai ki bechai par bechai na kare yahan tak ke wo khud kharid le ya chhod de."
"7589","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi doosre ki bechai par bechai na kare aur na saaman ka istiqbal karo yahan tak ke wo bazaar mein utar aaye."
"7590","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi doosre ki bechai par bechai na kare aur na koi doosre ki mangni par mangni kare."
"7591","[AI-translation] Koi shahri dehati ki taraf se bechai na kare, na najash karo, na koi apne bhai ki bechai par bechai kare, na us ke paighaam par paighaam bheje, aur na koi aurat apni behan ke talaq ki darkhwast kare taake us ka bartan khaali kare aur khud nikah kar le; us ke liye wohi hoga jo Allah ne us ke liye likha hai."
"7592","[AI-translation] Us aadmi se jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai Ansar se bughz nahi rakhega."
"7593","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi bahete pani mein peshab na kare phir us mein ghusl kare."
"7594","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi bahete pani mein peshab na kare phir us se wuzu kare."
"7595","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi bahete pani mein peshab na kare aur na us mein janabat ka ghusl kare."
"7596","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi thehre hue pani mein peshab na kare."
"7597","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi apne ghusl khane mein peshab na kare.. ..."
"7598","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi Qibla ki taraf munh kar ke peshab na kare."
"7599","[AI-translation] Koi aadmi kisi aurat ke ghar mein raat na guzare magar ye ke wo us se nikah-shuda ho ya mahram ho."
"7600","[AI-translation] Aadmi apne bhai ki bechai par bechai na kare aur na us ke paighaam par paighaam bheje magar ye ke wo use ijazat de."
"7601","[AI-translation] Aadmi apne bhai ki bechai par bechai na kare aur na apne bhai ke saude par sauda kare."
"7602","[AI-translation] Koi shahri dehati ki taraf se bechai na kare.. ..."
"7603","[AI-translation] Koi shahri dehati ki taraf se na beche; logon ko chhodo ke Allah ek doosre ko rizq de."
"7604","[AI-translation] Majlis ki baatein amanat hain."
"7605","[AI-translation] Log ye na kahen ke Muhammad apne sahaba ko qatl karwata hai."
"7606","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi sooraj nikalne ya doobne ke waqt namaz ke liye qasd na kare."
"7607","[AI-translation] Bechai ki majlis sirf raza-mandi se alag hoti hai."
"7608","[AI-translation] Koi apne mehman ke liye utna takalluf na kare jo us ki taqat mein na ho."
"7609","[AI-translation] Ihtilam ke baad yateemi nahi, aur raat tak din bhar chup rehna ibadat nahi hai."
"7610","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi maut ki tamanna na kare; agar wo nekokar hai to shayad us ki nekiyan barh jayein, aur agar badkar hai to shayad wo tauba kar le."
"7611","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi maut ki tamanna na kare us museebat ki wajah se jo us par aayi ho; pas agar karna hi ho to kahe: Allahumma ahyini ma kanat-il-hayatu khairan li wa tawaffani iza kanat-il-wafatu khairan li."
"7612","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi maut ki tamanna na kare aur na us ke aane se pehle us ki dua kare; kyunke jab tum mein se koi mar jata hai to us ka amal khatam ho jata hai; aur momin ki umar sirf bhalai hi mein barhti hai."
"7613","[AI-translation] Do deen walon ke darmiyan wirasat nahi hoti."
"7614","[AI-translation] Do mukhtalif millaton ke log ek doosre ke waris nahi hote."
"7615","[AI-translation] Aadmi wuzu karta hai aur achha wuzu karta hai phir namaz padhta hai to us ke darmiyan ke gunah maaf ho jate hain jo us namaz aur agle namaz ke darmiyan hote hain."
"7616","[AI-translation] Allah ki raah ki dhool aur jahannam ka dhuan kisi bande ke pet mein kabhi ek saath nahi jama hote, aur kanjoosi aur iman kisi bande ke dil mein kabhi ek saath nahi jama hote."
"7617","[AI-translation] Allah ki raah ki dhool aur jahannam ka dhuan kisi musalman ke naak ke sorakhon mein kabhi ek saath nahi hote."
"7618","[AI-translation] Kafir aur us ka qatil kabhi dozakh mein ek saath nahi honge."
"7619","[AI-translation] Do aise dozakh mein ek saath nahi honge ke ek doosre ko nuqsan de: momin jis ne kafir ko qatl kiya phir sedha raha."
"7620","[AI-translation] Do aise dozakh mein ek saath nahi honge ke ek doosre ko nuqsan de: musalman jis ne kafir ko qatl kiya phir sedha raha aur munsif raha; aur kisi momin ke pet mein Allah ki raah ki dhool aur jahannam ki tapish ek saath nahi jama hoti; aur kisi bande ke dil mein iman aur hasad ek saath nahi jama hote."
"7621","[AI-translation] Kisi aurat ka us ki phuphi ke saath aur na khala ke saath nikah ek saath na kiya jaye."
"7622","[AI-translation] Koi beta apne baap ka badla nahi chuka sakta magar ye ke wo use ghulam ki halat mein paye aur use kharid kar azad kar de."
"7623","[AI-translation] Das kodon se zyada nahi maara jayega magar Allah ki haddon mein se kisi hadd mein."
"7624","[AI-translation] Koi qawm aisi majlis nahi karti jis mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par durud na bhejein magar wo un par hasrat hoga, agarche wo jannat mein dakhil hon us sawab ki wajah se jo wo dekhenge."
"7625","[AI-translation] Kisi aurat ka apne maal mein koi tasarruf jaiz nahi jab us ka shohar us ki asmat ka malik ho."
"7626","[AI-translation] Kisi aurat ka koi atiya jaiz nahi magar ye ke us ka shohar ijazat de."
"7627","[AI-translation] Us ghar ke log bhookhe nahi rehte jinke paas khajoor ho."
"7628","[AI-translation] Chasht ki namaz ki pabandi sirf awwab karte hain; wo awwabin ki namaz hai."
"7629","[AI-translation] Ansar se sirf momin muhabbat karta hai aur un se sirf munafiq bughz rakhta hai; jis ne un se muhabbat ki Allah ne us se muhabbat ki, aur jis ne un se bughz kiya Allah ne us se bughz kiya."
"7630","[AI-translation] Allah walidain ki nafarmani pasand nahi karta; jis ke haan bachcha paida ho aur wo us ki taraf se aqiqa karna chahe to ladke ki taraf se do barabar bakriyan aur ladki ki taraf se ek bakri zibah kare."
"7631","[AI-translation] Ihtikar sirf gunahgar karta hai."
"7632","[AI-translation] Is saal ke baad koi mushrik hajj na kare aur na koi nanga ho kar Baitullah ka tawaf kare."
"7633","[AI-translation] Doodh ki hurmat sirf us cheez se sabit hoti hai jo sine mein aant khol de aur wo doodh pilane ki muddat se pehle ho."
"7634","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi neki ki kisi cheez ko haqeer na samjhe; pas agar use kuch na mile to apne bhai se khush-chehre ho kar mile; aur jab tum gosht kharido ya handi pakao to us ka shorba zyada karo aur us mein se apne padosi ke liye bhi nikalo."
"7635","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi do aadmiyon ke darmiyan ghusse ki halat mein faisla na kare."
"7636","[AI-translation] Koi aadmi kisi ki doodh dene wali janwar us ki ijazat ke baghair na dohe. Kya tum mein se koi ye pasand karta hai ke us ke godown mein aaya jaye aur us ka sandooq toda jaye aur us ka khana le jaya jaye? Un ke janwaron ke than un ke khane ka khazana hain; pas koi kisi ki janwar us ki ijazat ke baghair na dohe."
"7637","[AI-translation] Koi mere mimbar ke paas jhooti qasam na khaye, agarche chhali hui miswak par ho, magar us ke liye aag wajib ho jayegi."
"7638","[AI-translation] Koi mere is mimbar ke paas jhooti qasam na khaye, agarche hari miswak par ho, magar wo apna thikana aag mein bana lega."
"7639","[AI-translation] Kisi musalman ke azaad karda ghulam ke sath us ki ijazat ke baghair wala ka rishta na jodna jaiz nahi."
"7640","[AI-translation] Kutte ki qeemat, kahin ki nazrana aur badkari ki kamai halal nahi."
"7641","[AI-translation] Kisi musalman ka khoon halal nahi magar teen mein se ek se: wo aadmi jis ne shadi ke baad zina kiya, ya Islam ke baad murtad hua, ya kisi jaan ko na-haq qatl kiya to us ke badle qatl kiya jaye."
"7642","[AI-translation] Kisi musalman ka khoon halal nahi jo gawahi deta hai ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain, magar teen mein se ek se: wo aadmi jis ne shadi ke baad zina kiya to use rajm kiya jayega; ya wo aadmi jo Allah aur us ke Rasool se larte hue nikla to use qatl kiya jayega ya salib diya jayega ya zameen se nikal diya jayega; ya us ne kisi jaan ko qatl kiya to us ke badle qatl kiya jayega."
"7643","[AI-translation] Kisi musalman ka khoon halal nahi jo gawahi deta hai ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur main Allah ka Rasool hoon, magar teen mein se ek se: shadi-shuda zani, jaan ke badle jaan, aur apna deen chhod kar jama'at se alag hone wala."
"7644","[AI-translation] Na udhar aur bechai ka mel jaiz hai, na bechai mein do sharten, na us cheez ka munafa jis ka zimma na liya ho, aur na us cheez ki bechai jo tumhare paas na ho."
"7645","[AI-translation] Tum mein se kisi ke liye jaiz nahi ke Makkah mein hathiyar le kar chale."
"7646","[AI-translation] Kisi aurat ke liye jaiz nahi ke safar kare magar us ke mahram saath ho."
"7647","[AI-translation] Kisi aurat ke liye jaiz nahi ke roza rakhe aur us ka shohar maujood ho magar us ki ijazat se, ya us ke ghar mein kisi ko aane ki ijazat de magar us ki ijazat se; aur jo us ne us ke hukm ke baghair kharch kiya to us ka aadha use pahunchega."
"7648","[AI-translation] Kisi momina aurat ke liye jo Allah aur Aakhirat par iman rakhti ho jaiz nahi ke kisi murde par teen raat se zyada sog kare, magar shohar par chaar mahine das din."
"7649","[AI-translation] Kisi momina aurat ke liye jo Allah aur Aakhirat par iman rakhti ho jaiz nahi ke teen se zyada sog kare magar shohar par chaar mahine das din; pas wo na surma lagawe, na rangi hui chadar pehne magar asab ka kapda, na khushbu lagawe magar haiz se paak hone ke waqt qust-e-azfar ka zara sa."
"7650","[AI-translation] Kisi momina aurat ke liye jo Allah aur Aakhirat par iman rakhti ho jaiz nahi ke teen din ya us se zyada ka safar kare magar us ke baap, beta, shohar, bhai ya mahram saath ho."
"7651","[AI-translation] Kisi momina aurat ke liye jo Allah aur Aakhirat par iman rakhti ho jaiz nahi ke teen din ki musafat kare magar us ke mahram saath ho."
"7652","[AI-translation] Kisi momina aurat ke liye jo Allah aur Aakhirat par iman rakhti ho jaiz nahi ke ek din ki musafat kare magar us ke mahram saath ho."
"7653","[AI-translation] Kisi momina aurat ke liye jo Allah aur Aakhirat par iman rakhti ho jaiz nahi ke ek din raat ki musafat kare magar us ke mahram saath ho."
"7654","[AI-translation] Kisi momin aadmi ke liye jaiz nahi ke apna pani doosre ki kheti mein dale, na ghanimat kharide yahan tak ke taqseem ho jaye, na musalmanon ke fa'i maal ka kapda pehne yahan tak ke wo purana ho jaye phir us mein wapas de, aur na fa'i maal ka janwar sawari kare yahan tak ke wo lagar ho jaye phir us mein wapas de."
"7655","[AI-translation] Kisi aadmi ke liye jaiz nahi ke atiya de ya hadiya de phir us se rujoo kare, magar baap us cheez mein jo apni aulad ko de; aur atiya de kar rujoo karne wala us kutte ki tarah hai jo khata hai aur jab sair ho jata hai to qai karta hai phir apni qai mein wapas jata hai."
"7656","[AI-translation] Kisi aadmi ke liye jaiz nahi ke do aadmiyon ke darmiyan tafreeq kare magar un ki ijazat se."
"7657","[AI-translation] Kisi momin ke liye jaiz nahi ke apne bhai se teen din se zyada hijr kare."
"7658","[AI-translation] Kisi musalman ke liye jaiz nahi ke musalman ko dara de."
"7659","[AI-translation] Kisi musalman ke liye jaiz nahi ke apne bhai se teen din se zyada hijr kare; pas jis ne teen din se zyada hijr kiya aur mar gaya to wo aag mein dakhil hua."
"7660","[AI-translation] Kisi musalman ke liye jaiz nahi ke apne bhai se teen raat se zyada hijr kare; wo dono milte hain to ye munh pherta hai aur wo munh pherta hai; aur un mein behtar wo hai jo salam mein pehle kare."
"7661","[AI-translation] Mujhe tumhari ghanimat mein se is ke barabar bhi halal nahi magar khums; aur khums tum hi mein wapas kiya jata hai."
"7662","[AI-translation] Kisi muslim ka maal halal nahi magar us ki dil ki khushi se."
"7663","[AI-translation] Tumhare dil mein koi khatka na aaye us cheez se jo nasraniyat se milti ho."
"7664","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi apne bhai ki mangni par mangni na kare."
"7665","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi apne bhai ki mangni par mangni na kare yahan tak ke wo nikah kar le ya chhod de."
"7666","[AI-translation] Aadmi apne bhai ki mangni par mangni na kare, na us ke saude par sauda kare, na kisi aurat ka us ki phuphi ya khala ke saath nikah ek saath kiya jaye, aur na koi aurat apni behan ke talaq ki darkhwast kare taake uska bartan khaali kare aur khud nikah kar le; us ke liye wohi hoga jo Allah ne us ke liye likha hai."
"7667","[AI-translation] Tum mein se kisi ko us ka amal jannat mein dakhil nahi karega aur na dozakh se bachayega, aur na mujhe, magar Allah ki rehmat."
"7668","[AI-translation] Jannat mein koi aisa dakhil nahi hota jise dozakh mein us ka thikana na dikhaya jaye, agar us ne bura kiya hota, taake us ka shukr barhe; aur dozakh mein koi aisa dakhil nahi hota jise jannat mein us ka thikana na dikhaya jaye, agar us ne neki ki hoti, taake us par hasrat ho."
"7669","[AI-translation] Jannat mein sakht-tabiyat aur mutakabbir dakhil nahi hoga."
"7670","[AI-translation] Jannat mein sirf musalman jaan dakhil hogi, na Baitullah ka tawaf nanga karega, na musalman aur mushrik is saal ke baad Masjid-e-Haram mein ek saath jama honge; jis ka Nabi se ahad ho to us ka ahad us ki muddat tak hai, aur jis ka ahad na ho to us ki muddat chaar mahine hai."
"7671","[AI-translation] Jannat mein qata-talliq karne wala dakhil nahi hoga."
"7672","[AI-translation] Jannat mein chughal-khor dakhil nahi hoga."
"7673","[AI-translation] Jannat mein sharaab ka aadi dakhil nahi hoga."
"7674","[AI-translation] Jannat mein wo dakhil nahi hoga jis ke dil mein zarra bhar takabbur ho. Kaha gaya: Aadmi apne kapde achhe aur joote achhe pasand karta hai? Farmaya: Allah khud jameel hai aur jamal pasand karta hai; takabbur haq ko thukrana aur logon ko haqeer samajhna hai."
"7675","[AI-translation] Jannat mein wo dakhil nahi hoga jis ka padosi us ki buraiyon se mehfooz na ho."
"7676","[AI-translation] Jannat mein ehsan jatane wala, walidain ki nafarmani karne wala aur sharaab ka aadi dakhil nahi hoga."
"7677","[AI-translation] Madina mein Masih aur taoon dakhil nahi honge."
"7678","[AI-translation] Madina mein Masih Dajjal ka rua'b dakhil nahi hoga; us din us ke saat darwaze honge, har darwaze par do farishte honge."
"7679","[AI-translation] Aag mein wo dakhil nahi hoga jis ke dil mein rai ke daane bhar iman ho, aur jannat mein wo dakhil nahi hoga jis ke dil mein rai ke daane bhar takabbur ho."
"7680","[AI-translation] Aag mein un mein se koi dakhil nahi hoga jinhon ne darakht ke neeche bait kar bay'at ki."
"7681","[AI-translation] Aaj ke din ke baad koi aadmi kisi aurat ke paas us ke shohar ki ghair-maujoodgi mein na jaye magar us ke saath ek ya do aadmi hon."
"7682","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi zibah na kare yahan tak ke namaz padh le."
"7683","[AI-translation] Raat din khatam nahi honge yahan tak ke Lat aur Uzza ki ibadat ki jayegi; phir Allah ek pakeeza hawa bhejega jo har us shakhs ki rooh qabz kar legi jis ke dil mein rai ke daane bhar iman hoga; phir wo log baqi rahenge jin mein koi khair nahi, wo apne baap-dadon ke deen ki taraf laut jayenge."
"7684","[AI-translation] Raat din khatam nahi honge yahan tak ke ajami ghulamon mein se ek aadmi badshah banega jise Jahjah kaha jayega."
"7685","[AI-translation] Na kafir musalman ka waris hoga na musalman kafir ka."
"7686","[AI-translation] Koi apni hadiya se rujoo na kare magar baap apni aulad se; aur apni hadiya mein rujoo karne wala apni qai mein rujoo karne wale ki tarah hai."
"7687","[AI-translation] Qaza ko sirf dua badalti hai aur umar mein sirf neki barhati hai."
"7688","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi namaz mein hi rehta hai jab tak namaz use roke rakhe; use apne ghar walon ke paas lautne se sirf namaz hi rokti hai."
"7689","[AI-translation] Deen zahir rahega jab tak log iftar jaldi karenge, kyunke yahud aur nasrani iftar der se karte hain."
"7690","[AI-translation] Banda namaz mein hi rehta hai jab tak masjid mein namaz ka intezar karta hai, jab tak hadas na kare."
"7691","[AI-translation] Banda apne deen mein farakh-dili mein rehta hai jab tak na-haq khoon na kare."
"7692","[AI-translation] Allah is deen mein log paida karta rehta hai jinhe qayamat tak apni ita'at mein istemal karta hai."
"7693","[AI-translation] Momin hamesha neki mein tez-raftar rehta hai jab tak na-haq khoon na kare; pas jab us ne na-haq khoon kiya to wo thak kar ruk jata hai."
"7694","[AI-translation] Log us waqt tak bhalai par rahenge jab tak iftar jaldi karenge."
"7695","[AI-translation] Log us waqt tak bhalai par rahenge jab tak iftar jaldi karenge, kyunke yahud der karte hain."
"7696","[AI-translation] Log puchte rahenge yahan tak ke kaha jayega: Ye Allah ki makhlooq hai, to Allah ko kis ne paida kiya? Pas jo koi is mein se kuch paaye to kahe: Main Allah aur us ke Rasool par iman laya."
"7697","[AI-translation] Maghrib walon ka ek giroh haq par zahir rahega yahan tak ke qayamat qaim ho jaye."
"7698","[AI-translation] Bade aadmi ka dil do cheezon mein jawaan rehta hai: duniya ki muhabbat aur umar ki lambi umeed."
"7699","[AI-translation] Kuch log pehli saf se peeche rehte rahenge yahan tak ke Allah unhe aag mein peeche kar dega."
"7700","[AI-translation] Tumhari zabaan Allah ke zikr se hamesha tar rahe."
"7701","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ke kuch log haq par zahir rahenge yahan tak ke un ke paas Allah ka hukm aa jaye aur wo zahir honge."
"7702","[AI-translation] Ye amr Quraish mein rahega jab tak logon mein do aadmi baqi hain."
"7703","[AI-translation] Ye deen qaim rahega yahan tak ke tum par baarah khulafa honge, un sab par ummat jama hogi, wo sab Quraish se honge; phir harj hoga."
"7704","[AI-translation] Ye deen qaim rahega, musalmanon ka ek giroh is par larta rahega yahan tak ke qayamat qaim ho jaye."
"7705","[AI-translation] Bande ki dua qubool hoti rehti hai jab tak wo gunah ya qata-talliq ki dua na kare aur jaldi na kare; kahe: Main ne dua ki, main ne dua ki magar meri dua qubool nahi hui; pas is par udas ho jaye aur dua chhod de."
"7706","[AI-translation] Zani jab zina karta hai to us waqt momin nahi hota; chor jab chori karta hai to us waqt momin nahi hota; sharabi jab sharaab peeta hai to us waqt momin nahi hota; aur tauba us ke baad pesh ki jati hai."
"7707","[AI-translation] Zani jab zina karta hai to us waqt momin nahi hota; sharabi jab sharaab peeta hai to us waqt momin nahi hota; chor jab chori karta hai to us waqt momin nahi hota; aur jab wo aisi loot machata hai jis mein logon ki nigahein us ki taraf uthti hain to us waqt bhi momin nahi hota."
"7708","[AI-translation] Banda jab zina karta hai to us waqt momin nahi hota; jab chori karta hai to us waqt momin nahi hota; jab sharaab peeta hai to us waqt momin nahi hota; aur jab qatl karta hai to us waqt momin nahi hota."
"7709","[AI-translation] Aadmi apne maalik se us ka fazal maangta hai jo us ke paas hai aur wo use mana kar deta hai, to qayamat ke din us ke liye us ka fazal jo us ne mana kiya ek ganja saanp bana kar laya jayega."
"7710","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi zamane ko gaali na de, kyunke Allah hi zamana hai; aur koi angoor ko karm na kahe, kyunke karm musalman aadmi hai."
"7711","[AI-translation] Allah haq se sharm nahi karta; Allah haq se sharm nahi karta; aurton ke paas un ki pichhli jagah se na jao."
"7712","[AI-translation] Allah jis bande ki duniya mein aib-poshi karta hai, qayamat ke din bhi us ki aib-poshi karega."
"7713","[AI-translation] Koi banda kisi bande ka aib duniya mein chhupata hai magar Allah qayamat ke din us ka aib chhupa dega."
"7714","[AI-translation] Aadmi apni peeth ke bal na lete aur ek pair doosre par na rakhe."
"7715","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi teen pattharon se kam se istinja na kare."
"7716","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi apne bhai ki taraf hathiyar se ishara na kare; kyunke use maloom nahi, shayad shaitan us ke haath se hathiyar kheench le aur wo aag ke gaddhe mein gir jaye."
"7717","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ka jo aadmi sharaab piye to Allah us ki chalees din ki namaz qubool nahi karega."
"7718","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi khara ho kar na piye.. ..."
"7719","[AI-translation] Jo logon ka shukriya ada nahi karta wo Allah ka shukriya ada nahi karta."
"7720","[AI-translation] Jo gawahi deta hai ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur main Allah ka Rasool hoon, wo aag mein nahi jayega aur na aag use khayegi."
"7721","[AI-translation] Meri ummat mein se jo bhi Madina ki takleef aur sakhti par sabr kare, main qayamat ke din us ka shafi' ya gawah honga."
"7722","[AI-translation] Do dinon mein roza nahi: Eid-ul-Adha aur Eid-ul-Fitr."
"7723","[AI-translation] Jhoot sirf teen jagahon mein jaiz hai: aadmi apni biwi se use razi karne ke liye baat kare, jung mein jhoot, aur logon ke darmiyan sulah ke liye jhoot."
"7724","[AI-translation] Ek sa'a khajoor do sa'a ke badle durust nahi, na ek dirham do dirham ke badle; dirham dirham ke badle aur dinar dinar ke badle barabar barabar, un mein koi fazal nahi magar wazan mein."
"7725","[AI-translation] Kisi insan ke liye durust nahi ke kisi insan ko sajda kare; agar kisi insan ka kisi insan ko sajda karna durust hota to main aurat ko hukm deta ke wo apne shohar ko sajda kare us ke haq ki azmati ki wajah se. Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, agar shohar ke pair se us ke sar ke baal tak zakhm ho aur us se peep aur lahoo behta ho, phir wo use chaat-ti rahe, tab bhi us ke haq ko ada nahi kar sakti."
"7726","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi ek kapde mein namaz na padhe jis ka koi hissa us ke kandhe par na ho."
"7727","[AI-translation] Imam us jagah par namaz na padhe jahan us ne farz namaz padhi thi yahan tak ke wo jagah badal le."
"7728","[AI-translation] Oont ke baithne ki jagah mein namaz nahi padhi jati aur bakriyon ke baithne ki jagah mein padhi jati hai."
"7729","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi apne baal bandhe hue namaz na padhe."
"7730","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi Jumma ke din roza na rakhe magar ye ke us se ek din pehle ya baad ka roza bhi rakhe."
"7731","[AI-translation] Momin ko kaant ya us se badi koi takleef nahi pahunchti magar Allah us ki wajah se us ka darja buland karta hai aur us ka gunah mitata hai."
"7732","[AI-translation] Kisi bande ko koi museebat nahi pahunchti, chhoti ya badi, magar gunah ki wajah se; aur Allah bahut kuch maaf kar deta hai."
"7733","[AI-translation] Koi cheez kisi ko chhoot nahi lagati; phir pehle ko kis ne khujli lagai? Koi adwa nahi, na safar; Allah ne har jaan paida ki aur us ki zindagi, rizq aur musibatein likh din."
"7734","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi doosre ko daant na lagaye."
"7735","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi janabat ki halat mein thehre hue pani mein ghusl na kare."
"7736","[AI-translation] Jo aadmi Jumma ke din ghusl kare aur jitni taharat kar sakta ho kare, apne tel se tel lagaye ya apne ghar ki khushbu lagawe, phir nikle aur do aadmiyon ke darmiyan tafreeq na kare, phir apne maqdoor namaz padhe, phir jab imam bolna shuru kare to chup rahe, to us ke darmiyan ke gunah maaf ho jate hain jo us Jumma aur agle Jumma ke darmiyan hain."
"7737","[AI-translation] Tumhare sehri mein Bilal ki azan aur lamba safed ufuq tumhe dhoka na de yahan tak ke roshni phel jaye."
"7738","[AI-translation] Koi momin khayanat nahi karta."
"7739","[AI-translation] Koi hifazat qadr ko rok nahi sakti; dua us cheez mein nafa deti hai jo nazil ho chuki ho aur jo abhi nazil na hui ho; aur bala nazil hoti hai to dua us se takrati hai aur dono qayamat tak jujhte rehte hain."
"7740","[AI-translation] Do aadmi juda nahi hote magar raza-mandi se."
"7741","[AI-translation] Koi momin kisi momina se bughz na rakhe; agar us ki koi aadat na pasand ho to us ki doosri baat pasand aa jayegi."
"7742","[AI-translation] Qai karne wala roza nahi todega, na ihtilam wala, na hijama karwane wala."
"7743","[AI-translation] Jo Quran teen din se kam mein padhta hai wo use samajh nahi pata."
"7744","[AI-translation] Baap bete ke badle qisas mein qatl nahi kiya jayega."
"7745","[AI-translation] Allah tum mein se kisi ki namaz qubool nahi karta jab wo hadas kar baithe yahan tak ke wuzu kar le."
"7746","[AI-translation] Allah baghair taharat ke namaz qubool nahi karta aur na ghanimat mein khayanat se diya gaya sadqa."
"7747","[AI-translation] Allah haiz wali aurat ki namaz baghair sar dhakne ke qubool nahi karta."
"7748","[AI-translation] Allah taala us mushrik ka koi amal qubool nahi karta jo Islam ke baad shirk kare yahan tak ke wo mushrikeen ko chhod kar musalmanon se mil jaye."
"7749","[AI-translation] Baap bete ke badle qatl nahi kiya jayega."
"7750","[AI-translation] Aaj ke din ke baad qayamat tak koi Quraishi bandi bana kar qatl nahi kiya jayega."
"7751","[AI-translation] Koi momin kafir ke badle qatl nahi kiya jayega aur na ahad wala apne ahad ke dauran."
"7752","[AI-translation] Koi musalman kafir ke badle qatl nahi kiya jayega."
"7753","[AI-translation] Logo ko qissa sirf amir, ya us ka mamoor, ya mutakabbir bayan karta hai."
"7754","[AI-translation] Logo par qissa sirf amir, mamoor ya riyakar bayan karta hai."
"7755","[AI-translation] Qazi do aadmiyon ke darmiyan ghusse ki halat mein faisla na kare."
"7756","[AI-translation] Koi ek muqadme mein do faisle na kare, aur na koi do jhagraluon ke darmiyan ghusse ki halat mein faisla kare."
"7757","[AI-translation] Koi qawm Allah ka zikr karke nahi baithti magar farishte unhe gher lete hain, rehmat unhe dhak leti hai, un par sakeena nazil hoti hai, aur Allah unhe apne paas ke farishton mein yaad karta hai."
"7758","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi ye na kahe: Apne Rab ko khilao, apne Rab ko wuzu karwao, apne Rab ko pani pilao; aur koi ye na kahe: Mera Rab; balke kahe: Mera sardar aur mera maalik. Aur tum mein se koi ye na kahe: Mera ghulam aur meri laundi; balke kahe: Mera ladka aur meri ladki aur mera ghulam."
"7759","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi ye na kahe: Mera nafs khabees ho gaya; balke kahe: Mera nafs machal gaya hai."
"7760","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi ye na kahe ke main falani aayat bhool gaya; balke wo bhoolaya gaya hai."
"7761","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi karm na kahe, kyunke karm musalman aadmi hai; balke kahe: Angoor ke bagh."
"7762","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi apne bhai ko Jumma ke din us ki jagah se na uthaye aur phir us ki jagah baithe; balke kahe: Jagah banao."
"7763","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi ye na kahe: Allahumma aghfir li in shi'ta, Allahumma irhamni in shi'ta, Allahumma urzuqni in shi'ta; balke sawal ko pukhta irada se kare, kyunke wo jo chahta hai karta hai, use majboor karne wala koi nahi."
"7764","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi ye na kahe: Main Yunus bin Matta se behtar hoon."
"7765","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi ye na kahe: Mera ghulam aur meri laundi; tum sab Allah ke bande ho aur tumhari tamam aurtein Allah ki laundiyan hain; balke kahe: Mera ladka, meri ladki, mera khidmatgar aur meri khidmatgarni."
"7766","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi ye na kahe: Mera ghulam ya meri laundi; aur na ghulam kahe: Mera Rab aur meri Rabba; balke maalik kahe: Mera ladka aur meri ladki, aur ghulam kahe: Mera sardar aur meri sardaar; kyunke tum sab ghulam ho aur Rab Allah azza wa jall hai."
"7767","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi angoor ko karm na kahe, kyunke karm momin ka dil hai."
"7768","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi ye na kahe: Ae zamane ki khwari! Kyunke Allah hi zamana hai."
"7769","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi namaz ke liye na khara ho jab use takleef ho."
"7770","[AI-translation] Aadmi kisi aadmi ko us ki majlis se na uthaye aur phir us ki jagah baithe."
"7771","[AI-translation] Aadmi kisi aadmi ko us ki majlis se na uthaye aur phir us ki jagah baithe; balke jagah banao aur kushada karo."
"7772","[AI-translation] Allah ki raah mein koi zakhm nahi khata - aur Allah behtar janta hai kaun us ki raah mein zakhm khata hai - magar qayamat ke din us ka zakhm khoon behta hua aayega, rang khoon ka aur khushbu kasturi ki."
"7773","[AI-translation] Laanat karne wale qayamat ke din na shafa'at karne wale honge na gawah."
"7774","[AI-translation] Momin laanat karne wala nahi hota."
"7775","[AI-translation] Kisi musalman ke liye jaiz nahi ke musalman se teen din se zyada hijr kare; pas jab wo use mile to teen martaba salam kare aur wo har martaba jawab na de to wo apne gunah ka bojh le kar wapas hua."
"7776","[AI-translation] Madina walon ke saath koi makr na kare magar wo aise pighal jayega jaise namak pani mein pighalta hai."
"7777","[AI-translation] Ihram wala qamees na pehne, na amaam, na shalwar, na topi wala libas, na aisa kapda jis mein wars ya za'faran laga ho, aur na moze, magar ye ke joote na mile to moze pehne aur unhe takhno se neeche tak kaat le."
"7778","[AI-translation] Aag us aadmi ko nahi chhuegi jo Allah ke khauf se rota hai yahan tak ke doodh than mein wapas aaye; aur Allah ki raah ki dhool aur jahannam ka dhuan kisi musalman ke naak ke sorakhon mein kabhi ek saath nahi jama hote."
"7779","[AI-translation] Momin ek bill se do martaba dang nahi khata."
"7780","[AI-translation] Quran ko sirf paak chhuta hai."
"7781","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi peshab karte waqt apne azo ko daayein haath se na chhue, na bait-ul-khala se daayein haath se istinja kare, aur na bartan mein saans de."
"7782","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi ek joote ya ek moze mein na chale; dono pehne ya dono utaar de."
"7783","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi fazal pani na roke taake us se ghaas rok sake."
"7784","[AI-translation] Koi padosi apne padosi ko apni deewar mein lakri gaadne se na roke."
"7785","[AI-translation] Fazal pani na roka jaye aur na kunwan ka paani roka jaye."
"7786","[AI-translation] Tum mein se kisi ko Bilal ki azan sehri se na roke; kyunke wo raat mein azan deta hai taake tum mein khara namaz padhne wala wapas ho jaye aur soya hua bedar ho jaye; aur fajr wo nahi hai ke aisa ho yahan tak ke aisa ho - ufuq-e-aasman mein chaurai ikhtiyar kare."
"7787","[AI-translation] Koi musalman nahi marta aur us ki namaz-e-janaza musalmanon ki ek jama'at padhti hai jo sau ya us se zyada ho to wo us ki shafa'at karne wale hote hain."
"7788","[AI-translation] Koi musalman aadmi nahi marta magar Allah us ki jagah dozakh mein yahudi ya nasrani dal deta hai."
"7789","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi na mare jab main tumhare darmiyan hoon magar tum mujhe ittila do; beshak meri us par namaz rehmat hai."
"7790","[AI-translation] Tum mein se kisi aurat ke teen bachche na maren ke wo un par sawab ki niyat se sabr kare, magar wo jannat mein dakhil hogi; aur do bhi."
"7791","[AI-translation] Kisi musalman ke teen bachche na maren ke wo aag mein dakhil ho magar qasam poora karne ke liye."
"7792","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi na mare magar wo Allah taala se achha guman rakhta ho."
"7793","[AI-translation] Tum par koi qasam aur nazar lazim nahi Rab ki nafarmani mein, na qata-talliq mein, aur na us cheez mein jo tum malik nahi."
"7794","[AI-translation] Kisi ke liye munasib nahi ke meri is anguthi ke naqsh par naqsh banaye."
"7795","[AI-translation] Siddiq ke liye munasib nahi ke laanat karne wala ho."
"7796","[AI-translation] Kisi bande ke liye munasib nahi ke kahe: Main Yunus bin Matta se behtar hoon."
"7797","[AI-translation] Kisi momin ke liye munasib nahi ke apne nafs ko zaleel kare: apne aap ko aisi bala mein daale jo us ki taqat se bahar ho."
"7798","[AI-translation] Ye mutaqqiyon ke liye munasib nahi - yani resham."
"7799","[AI-translation] Do aadmi teesre ke bina kaan mein kaan na karein, kyunke ye use ghamgeen karega."
"7800","[AI-translation] Mard mard ki sharamgah na dekhe aur aurat aurat ki sharamgah na dekhe; aur na mard mard ke saath ek kapde mein ho aur na aurat aurat ke saath ek kapde mein."
"7801","[AI-translation] Allah us aadmi ki taraf nahi dekhta jo kisi mard ya aurat ke paas us ki pichhli jagah se aaye."
"7802","[AI-translation] Allah us mard ki taraf nahi dekhta jo apni biwi ke paas us ki pichhli jagah se aaye."
"7803","[AI-translation] Allah us ki taraf nahi dekhta jo takabbur se apna kapda ghasitta hai."
"7804","[AI-translation] Allah qayamat ke din us ki taraf nahi dekhega jo maghroori se apna tehband ghasitta hai."
"7805","[AI-translation] Koi tawaf karne wala wapas na ho yahan tak ke us ka aakhri ahad Baitullah ka tawaf ho."
"7806","[AI-translation] Use koi nafa nahi pahunchega kyunke us ne kabhi ye nahi kaha: Ae mere Rab, qayamat ke din mere gunah maaf kar de."
"7807","[AI-translation] Koi meri is anguthi ke naqsh par naqsh na banaye."
"7808","[AI-translation] Hadd lag chuke zani ka nikah sirf us jaisi se ho sakta hai."
"7809","[AI-translation] Ihram wala na nikah kare, na kisi ka nikah karaye, na mangni kare."
"7810","[AI-translation] Beemar janwar rakhne wale ko sehat-mand janwaron ke paas na aane do."
